,'Member support forum'=>'Forum atilẹyin ọmọ ẹgbẹ','%1$sgrab%2$s %3$s'=>'%1$sgrab%2$s %3$s','%s (free install)'=>'%s (fifi sori ọfẹ)','%1$sbuy%2$s %3$s'=>'%1$sbuy%2$s %3$s','%s info/purchase'=>'%s alaye/rà','Role level is mostly deprecated. However, it still determines eligibility for Post Author assignment and limits the application of user editing capabilities.'=>'Ipele ipa ti fẹrẹ kọja. Bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ bẹ́ẹ̀, ó ṣi ń tọ́ka sí ìmúlò fun ìtọ́ka Post Author àti dínà ìmúlò agbara àtúnṣe olumulo.','Level:'=>'Ipele:','Create this role definition in new (future) sites'=>'Ṣẹda ìtọnisọna ipa yìí ní àwọn aaye tuntun (ìjọba) ','Include in new sites.'=>'Kó sí àwọn aaye tuntun.','Copy / update this role definition to all sites now'=>'Daakọ / ṣe àtúnṣe ìtọnisọna ipa yìí sí gbogbo awọn aaye nísinsin yìí','Sync role to all sites.'=>'Sẹ́yìn ipa sí gbogbo awọn aaye.','Copy option settings to all sites now'=>'Daakọ àṣàyàn ìtọ́ka sí gbogbo awọn aaye nísinsin yìí','Sync options to all sites.'=>'Sẹ́yìn àṣàyàn sí gbogbo awọn aaye.','Unnamed application password'=>'Ọrọ aṣínà ohun elo ti a ko darukọ','You do not have permission to restore backup.'=>'Iwọ kò ní ìmúlò láti tún ẹ̀dá àtúnṣe padà.','Roles and Capabilities'=>'Àwọn ipa àti Agbara','New backup saved.'=>'Àtúnṣe àtúnṣe tuntun ti pamọ.','Roles and Capabilities restored from initial backup.'=>'Àwọn ipa àti Agbara ti a tún ṣe àtúnṣe láti àtúnṣe ibẹrẹ.','Restore failed. No backup found.'=>'Ipadà kọja. Ko si ẹda abẹyẹ.','%s restored from last backup.'=>'%s ti ipadà lati ẹda abẹyẹ to kẹhin.','Roles and Capabilities restored from selected auto-backup.'=>'Awọn ipa ati Awọn agbara ti ipadà lati ẹda abẹyẹ aifọwọyi ti a yan.','Please upload a file to import'=>'Jọwọ gbe faili kan lati wọle','Please upload a valid .json file'=>'Jọwọ gbe faili .json to wulo','Error importing settings! Please try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe ni gbigbe awọn eto! Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Error importing settings! Please check that you uploaded a valid json file.'=>'Aṣiṣe ni gbigbe awọn eto! Jọwọ ṣayẹwo pe o gbe faili json to wulo.','Skipped %d invalid or unsupported import entries.'=>'Afojusun %d awọn iwe aṣẹ gbigbe ti ko wulo tabi ti a ko ni atilẹyin.','%s successfully imported from uploaded data.'=>'%s ni a ti gbe wọle ni aṣeyọri lati data ti a gbe.','No valid backup data found to import.'=>'Ko si data abẹyẹ to wulo ti a ri lati wọle.','Roles and Capabilities reset to WordPress defaults'=>'Awọn ipa ati Awọn agbara ti tunto si awọn ipilẹ WordPress','Backup Tool for PublishPress Capabilities'=>'Ọpa Abẹyẹ fun Awọn Agbara PublishPress','Restore'=>'Ipadà','Backup'=>'Abẹyẹ','Reset Roles'=>'Tunṣe Awọn ipa','Export / Import'=>'Gbejade / Wọle','Backup Roles and Capabilities'=>'Abẹyẹ Awọn ipa ati Awọn agbara','PublishPress Capabilities automatically creates a backup on installation and whenever you save changes. The initial backup and last %d auto-backups are kept.'=>'Awọn Agbara PublishPress ṣẹda abẹyẹ laifọwọyi ni fifi sori ẹrọ ati nigbakugba ti o ba fi awọn ayipada pamọ. Ẹda abẹyẹ ibẹrẹ ati awọn abẹyẹ aifọwọyi %d ti o kẹhin ni a pa.','A backup created on this screen replaces any previous manual backups, but is never automatically replaced.'=>'Ẹda abẹyẹ ti a ṣẹda lori iboju yii rọpo eyikeyi awọn abẹyẹ afọwọṣe ti tẹlẹ, ṣugbọn a ko rọpo aifọwọyi rẹ.','Manual Backup'=>'Abẹyẹ Afọwọṣe','Last Manual Backup - %s'=>'Abẹyẹ Afọwọṣe Kẹhin - %s','Last Backup'=>'Abẹyẹ Kẹhin','Restore Previous Roles and Capabilities'=>'Ipadà Awọn ipa ati Awọn agbara Ti tẹlẹ','PublishPress Capabilities automatically creates a backup on installation and whenever you save changes.'=>'Awọn Agbara PublishPress ṣẹda abẹyẹ laifọwọyi ni fifi sori ẹrọ ati nigbakugba ti o ba fi awọn ayipada pamọ.','On this screen, you can restore an earlier version of your roles and capabilities.'=>'Ninu iboju yii, o le padà si ẹya earlier ti awọn ipa ati awọn agbara rẹ.','Available Backups:'=>'Awọn Abẹyẹ Ti o wa:','all roles'=>'gbogbo ipa','Manual backup of %s (%s)'=>'Abẹyẹ afọwọṣe ti %s (%s)','Auto-backup of all roles (%s)'=>'Abẹyẹ aifọwọyi ti gbogbo ipa (%s)','Initial backup of all roles'=>'Abẹyẹ ibẹrẹ ti gbogbo ipa','Restore Selected Roles'=>'Ipadà Awọn ipa Ti a Yan','Show changes from current roles only'=>'Fihan awọn ayipada lati ọdọ awọn ipa lọwọlọwọ nikan','Initial Backup - %s'=>'Abẹyẹ Ibẹrẹ - %s','Initial Backup'=>'Abẹyẹ Ibẹrẹ','%s (%s roles)'=>'%s (%s ipa)','(this role will be removed if you restore backup)'=>'(ipa yii yoo yọkuro ti o ba padà abẹyẹ)','%s (level %s)'=>'%s (ipele %s)','No changes'=>'Ko si awọn ayipada','Reset WordPress Defaults'=>'Tunṣe Awọn ipilẹ WordPress','Warning:'=>'Ikilọ:','Reseting default Roles and Capabilities will set them to the WordPress install defaults.'=>'Tun awọn ipa ati agbara aiyipada pada yoo ṣeto wọn si awọn aiyipada fifi sori WordPress.','If you have installed any plugin that adds new roles or capabilities, these will be lost.'=>'Ti o ba ti fi sori ẹrọ eyikeyi afikun ti o ṣafikun awọn ipa tuntun tabi agbara, iwọnyi yoo sọnu.','It is recommended to use this only as a last resource!'=>'A ṣ建议 lati lo eyi nikan bi orisun ikẹhin!','Reset Roles and Capabilities to WordPress defaults'=>'Tun awọn ipa ati agbara pada si awọn aiyipada WordPress','You are about to reset Roles and Capabilities to WordPress defaults.
 \'Cancel\' to stop, \'OK\' to reset.'=>'O n bọ lati tun awọn ipa ati agbara pada si awọn aiyipada WordPress. \'Fagilee\' lati da duro, \'OK\' lati tun pada.','Reset to WordPress defaults'=>'Tun pada si awọn aiyipada WordPress','Export Settings'=>'Gbigbe Eto','Export the plugin settings for this site as a .json file. This allows you to easily import the configuration into another site.'=>'Gbigbe awọn eto afikun fun aaye yii gẹgẹbi faili .json. Eyi n jẹ ki o rọrun lati gbe akopọ naa si aaye miiran.','Select the roles to include in this export.'=>'Yan awọn ipa lati pẹlu ninu igbasilẹ yii.','Export'=>'Gbigbe','Import Settings'=>'Gbigbe Eto','Please make a \'Manual Backup\' in the backup tab to enable backup restore in case anything goes wrong.'=>'Jọwọ ṣe \'Afẹyinti Ẹrọ\' ni taabu afẹyinti lati mu ki afẹyinti pada ni ọran ti ohunkohun ba lọ ni aṣiṣe.','Import the plugin settings from a .json file. This file can be obtained by exporting the settings on another site using the form above.'=>'Gbigbe awọn eto afikun lati faili .json. Faili yii le gba nipasẹ gbigbe awọn eto lori aaye miiran nipa lilo fọọmu loke.','Before importing, we recommend using the "Backup" tab to create a backup of your current settings.'=>'Ṣaaju ki o to gbe, a ṣ建议 lati lo taabu "Afẹyinti" lati ṣẹda afẹyinti ti awọn eto rẹ lọwọlọwọ.','Import settings file'=>'Gbigbe faili eto','Sync feature status to all sites in this network.'=>'Iṣakoso ipo ẹya si gbogbo awọn aaye ni nẹtiwọọki yii.','Network feature synchronization help'=>'Iranlọwọ iṣọpọ ẹya nẹtiwọọki','Enabling or disabling a feature will apply its new status to all sites.'=>'Mimu tabi didi ẹya kan yoo lo ipo rẹ tuntun si gbogbo awọn aaye.','Admin Feature Restrictions'=>'Awọn ihamọ Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe Admin','Toggle all'=>'Tan gbogbo','Wildcard enabled'=>'Wildcard ti mu ṣiṣẹ','URL targeted'=>'URL ti a fojusi','URL wildcard'=>'URL wildcard','Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ','Admin Features allows you to remove elements from the admin area and toolbar.'=>'Awọn ẹya Admin n jẹ ki o yọ awọn eroja kuro ni agbegbe admin ati toolbar.','No change'=>'Ko si iyipada','This feature is denied'=>'Ẹya yii ni a kọju','How to use Admin Features'=>'Bawo ni a ṣe le lo Awọn ẹya Admin','Admin Features Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Awọn ẹya Admin','Hide Submenus'=>'Tọju Awọn Submenus','You do not have permission to manage menu restrictions.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣakoso awọn ihamọ akojọ.','Settings updated for all roles.'=>'Awọn eto ti ni imudojuiwọn fun gbogbo awọn ipa.','Settings updated.'=>'Awọn eto ti ni imudojuiwọn.','Saving Menu Order...'=>'Fipamọ Iṣẹ Akojọ...','Saving Menu Name...'=>'Fipamọ Orukọ Akojọ...','Menu Name can not be empty.'=>'Orukọ Akojọ ko le jẹ ofo.','Change Icon'=>'Yipada Aami','Search icons...'=>'Wa awọn aami...','Menu icon updated'=>'Aami akojọ ti ni imudojuiwọn','Error updating menu icon'=>'Aṣiṣe ni imudojuiwọn aami akojọ','Duplicate menu with this Menu URL already exists'=>'Aiyipada akojọ pẹlu URL Akojọ yii ti wa tẹlẹ','Duplicate submenu with the menu url already exist'=>'Aiyipada akojọ-kekere pẹlu URL akojọ ti wa tẹlẹ','Admin Menu Order reset successfully. Reloading page...'=>'Akojọ Oludari aṣẹ tunṣe ni aṣeyọri. Nṣiṣẹ oju-iwe...','Admin Menu Names reset successfully. Reloading page...'=>'Akojọ Orukọ Oludari aṣẹ tunṣe ni aṣeyọri. Nṣiṣẹ oju-iwe...','Admin Menu Cache reset successfully. Reloading page...'=>'Akojọ Cache Oludari aṣẹ tunṣe ni aṣeyọri. Nṣiṣẹ oju-iwe...','Admin Menu reset successfully. Reloading page...'=>'Akojọ Oludari aṣẹ tunṣe ni aṣeyọri. Nṣiṣẹ oju-iwe...','Menu deleted successfully.'=>'Akojọ ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Invalid data'=>'Data ti ko tọ','Menu Name Updated for all roles.'=>'Orukọ Akojọ ti ni imudojuiwọn fun gbogbo awọn ipa.','Menu Name Updated.'=>'Orukọ Akojọ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','Menu Order Updated.'=>'Aṣẹ Akojọ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','You do not have permission to access this page.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati wọle si oju-iwe yii.','Admin Menus'=>'Akojọ Oludari','Save for All Roles'=>'Fipamọ fun Gbogbo Awọn Ipa','Add custom menu links, submenu links, and separators to the WordPress admin menu. This feature is available in PublishPress Capabilities Pro.'=>'Fi awọn ọna asopọ akojọ aṣa kun, awọn ọna asopọ akojọ-kekere, ati awọn ayẹwo si akojọ oludari WordPress. Ẹya yii wa ninu PublishPress Capabilities Pro.','Type:'=>'Iru:','Menu Link'=>'Ọna asopọ Akojọ','Submenu Link'=>'Ọna asopọ Akojọ-kekere','Menu Separator'=>'Ayẹwo Akojọ','Submenu Separator'=>'Ayẹwo Akojọ-kekere','Position:'=>'Ipo:','After'=>'Lẹ́yìn','Menu Title:'=>'Akole Akojọ:','My Custom Menu'=>'Akojọ Aṣa Mi','Menu Title is required.'=>'Akole Akojọ jẹ dandan.','Separator Style'=>'Iru Ayẹwo','Line (____________________)'=>'Ọna (____________________)','Empty Space'=>'Ibi ofo','Text'=>'Ọrọ','Separator Color'=>'Color Ayẹwo','Menu URL:'=>'URL Akojọ:','Enter an internal link such as %1s or an external link such as %2s. Any link can only be used once for a Menu URL.'=>'Tẹ ọna asopọ inu bi %1s tabi ọna asopọ ita bi %2s. Ọna asopọ eyikeyi le ṣee lo lẹẹkan ṣoṣo fun URL Akojọ.','Menu with this url already exist.'=>'Akojọ pẹlu URL yii ti wa tẹlẹ.','Menu Capability:'=>'Agbara Akojọ:','This is the capability required to see this menu. For example: %1s or %2s If you\'re entering a custom capability, remember to add and assign it to preferred roles on the capabilities page'=>'Eyi ni agbara ti a nilo lati ri akojọ yii. Fun apẹẹrẹ: %1s tabi %2s Ti o ba n tẹ agbara aṣa, ranti lati fi kun ki o si fi fun awọn ipa ti a fẹ lori oju-iwe awọn agbara','Menu Capability is required.'=>'Agbara Akojọ jẹ dandan.','Menu Icon'=>'Aami Akojọ','Save Menu Link'=>'Fipamọ Ọna asopọ Akojọ','New Menu Link'=>'Ọna asopọ Akojọ Tuntun','(Can\'t detect menu name)'=>'(Kò le ṣawari orukọ akojọ)','This menu name is not available in menu global data or directly registered with the menu'=>'Orukọ akojọ aṣayan yii ko si ninu data akojọ aṣayan gbogbo tabi ti forukọsilẹ taara pẹlu akojọ aṣayan naa','%s Role'=>'%s Iṣẹ','All Roles'=>'Gbogbo Awọn Iṣẹ','Save'=>'Fipamọ','Cancel'=>'Fagilee','This option is disabled to prevent complete lockout'=>'Aṣayan yii ti wa ni pipade lati ṣe idiwọ idasilẹ patapata','Are you sure you want to delete %1s? %2s %3s'=>'Ṣe o da ọ loju pe o fẹ pa %1s? %2s %3s','Delete'=>'Pa','The capability required to access this menu is %s'=>'Agbara ti o nilo lati wọle si akojọ aṣayan yii ni %s','Rename Menu'=>'Tun Orukọ Akojọ','Move Up'=>'Gbe Soke','Move Down'=>'Gbe Salẹ','No menu found'=>'Akọjọ aṣayan ko ri','How to use Admin Menus'=>'Bawo ni lati lo Awọn Akojọ Alakoso','Admin Menus allows you to edit the admin menu links and control who has access.'=>'Awọn Akojọ Alakoso gba ọ laaye lati ṣatunkọ awọn ọna asopọ akojọ aṣayan alakoso ati ṣakoso ẹniti o ni iraye si.','Admin Menus Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Akojọ Alakoso','Show Menu Slugs'=>'Fi Awọn Slugs Akojọ Han','Reset Admin Menus'=>'Tun Awọn Akojọ Alakoso','You can reset the admin menu order and name to their original position and names. You can also reset the menu cache to fix any missing menu issues.'=>'O le tun ipo ati orukọ akojọ aṣayan alakoso si ipo ati awọn orukọ wọn ti atilẹba. O tun le tun ibi ipamọ akojọ aṣayan lati ṣatunṣe eyikeyi iṣoro akojọ aṣayan ti o padanu.','Reset Menu Order'=>'Tun Ipo Akojọ','Reset Cached Menu'=>'Tun Akojọ Ti a Fipamọ','Reset Menu Names and Icons'=>'Tun Awọn Orukọ Akojọ ati Awọn Aami','Reset Selected Option'=>'Tun Aṣayan Ti a Yan','You cannot change styles for this role.'=>'O ko le yi awọn ara fun iṣẹ yii pada.','You cannot change admin styles.'=>'O ko le yi awọn ara alakoso pada.','Custom style slugs must start with ppc-custom-style-.'=>'Awọn slugs ara aṣa gbọdọ bẹrẹ pẹlu ppc-custom-style-.','The Free edition supports one custom admin style.'=>'Ẹya Free n ṣe atilẹyin aṣa alakoso kan.','A style name is required.'=>'Orukọ ara nilo.','You cannot delete admin styles.'=>'O ko le pa awọn ara alakoso.','Custom style not found.'=>'Aṣa aṣa ko ri.','Default'=>'Aiyipada','Custom style "%s" saved successfully.'=>'Aṣa aṣa "%s" ti fipamọ ni aṣeyọri.','Custom style "%s" deleted successfully.'=>'Aṣa aṣa "%s" ti pa ni aṣeyọri.','Custom style name cannot be empty.'=>'Orukọ ara aṣa ko le jẹ ofo.','Admin styles saved successfully.'=>'Awọn ara alakoso ti fipamọ ni aṣeyọri.','Admin Styles'=>'Awọn Ara Alakoso','Setting'=>'Eto','Value'=>'Iye','Admin Color Scheme'=>'Ẹya Awọ Alakoso','Sets the admin color scheme for all users. Click a scheme to preview it instantly.'=>'N ṣeto ẹya awọ alakoso fun gbogbo awọn olumulo. Tẹ ẹya kan lati ṣe afihan rẹ lẹsẹkẹsẹ.','Start from template'=>'Bẹrẹ lati awoṣe','Blank Template'=>'Awoṣe ofo','Add Custom Style'=>'Ṣafikun aṣa aṣa','Edit custom style'=>'Ṣatunkọ aṣa aṣa','Edit Color Style'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọ aṣa','Customize colors for different admin elements. Changes are previewed instantly.'=>'Ṣe aṣa awọn awọ fun awọn eroja admin oriṣiriṣi. Awọn ayipada ni a fihan lẹsẹkẹsẹ.','Add more than one custom admin styles. This feature is available in PublishPress Capabilities Pro.'=>'Ṣafikun ju aṣa admin kan lọ. Iṣẹ yii wa ni PublishPress Capabilities Pro.','Add CSS selectors (class or ID), choose a style variation, and set a brand color.'=>'Ṣafikun awọn aṣayan CSS (kilasi tabi ID), yan iyatọ aṣa kan, ki o si ṣeto awọ ami kan.','Add New Element'=>'Ṣafikun Ẹya Tuntun','Selector'=>'Aṣayan','e.g. .publishpress-wrap h1, #my-plugin-header'=>'e.g. .PublishPress-wrap h1, #my-plugin-header','Variation'=>'Iyatọ','Background'=>'Ẹgbẹ','Border'=>'Ààlà','Brand Color'=>'Awọ Ami','Remove'=>'Yọkuro','Custom Style Name'=>'Orukọ Aṣa Aṣa','e.g., Company Branding, Dark Mode'=>'e.g., Branding Ile-iṣẹ, Ipo Dudu','Delete Custom Style'=>'Parẹ Aṣa Aṣa','Are you sure you want to delete this %1s? %2s %3s'=>'Ṣe o dajudaju pe o fẹ parẹ eyi %1s? %2s %3s','Custom Style'=>'Aṣa Aṣa','Save Custom Style'=>'Fipamọ Aṣa Aṣa','Custom Admin Logo'=>'Logo Aṣa Admin','Upload a custom logo to replace the WordPress icon in the admin bar. Recommended: 20px by 20px in SVG or PNG format.'=>'Gbe logo aṣa kan silẹ lati rọpo aami WordPress ni bar admin. Ti a ṣe iṣeduro: 20px nipasẹ 20px ni SVG tabi PNG ọna kika.','Admin logo preview'=>'Ihamọ logo admin','Select Image'=>'Yan Aworan','Custom Favicon'=>'Favicon Aṣa','Upload a custom favicon for the admin area. Recommended: 16px by 16px or 32px by 32px in SVG or PNG format.'=>'Gbe favicon aṣa kan silẹ fun agbegbe admin. Ti a ṣe iṣeduro: 16px nipasẹ 16px tabi 32px nipasẹ 32px ni SVG tabi PNG ọna kika.','Admin favicon preview'=>'Ihamọ favicon admin','Admin Font Family'=>'Idile Font Admin','Set a font stack for the admin area, for example "Segoe UI", sans-serif.'=>'Ṣeto akojọpọ font fun agbegbe admin, fun apẹẹrẹ "Segoe UI", sans-serif.','Preset Fonts'=>'Fonts Ti a Ṣeto','Custom Value'=>'Iye Aṣa','Admin font family preset'=>'Idile font admin ti a ṣeto','Custom admin font family'=>'Idile font admin aṣa','Admin Font Size'=>'Iwọn Font Admin','Set a base font size for the admin area. Leave empty to use the default WordPress size.'=>'Ṣeto iwọn font ipilẹ fun agbegbe admin. Fi silẹ lati lo iwọn WordPress aiyipada.','Named Sizes'=>'Iwọn ti a npè ni','Pixel Sizes'=>'Iwọn Pixel','Typography Overrides'=>'Iṣakoso Typography','Optional target-specific typography rules for common admin elements.'=>'Awọn ofin typography pato ti a ṣafikun fun awọn eroja admin ti o wọpọ.','Body Text'=>'Iwe Ara','Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ','Headings'=>'Awọn akọle','Admin Menu'=>'Menù Admin','Admin Bar'=>'Bar Admin','Form Fields'=>'Awọn aaye Fọọmu','Buttons'=>'Awọn bọtini','Target'=>'Afojusun','Font Family'=>'Ẹbi Fonti','Font Size'=>'Iwọn Fonti','Preset'=>'Preset','Custom'=>'Adani','Font family for %s'=>'Ẹbi fonti fun %s','Custom font family for %s'=>'Ẹbi fonti adani fun %s','Font size for %s'=>'Iwọn fonti fun %s','Admin Footer Text'=>'Iwe Ara Ẹsẹ Admin','Replace the default "Thanks for creating with WordPress" message in the admin footer.'=>'Rọpo ifiranṣẹ aiyipada "O ṣeun fun ṣiṣẹda pẹlu WordPress" ni ẹsẹ admin.','Replace "Howdy"'=>'Rọpo "Howdy"','Replace "Howdy" in the admin bar.'=>'Rọpo "Howdy" ni bar admin.','Control Settings'=>'Ṣakoso Eto','Control how admin styles are applied to users.'=>'Ṣakoso bi awọn aṣa admin ṣe n lo si awọn olumulo.','Hide Admin Color Scheme settings in user profile'=>'Pa awọn eto awọ Admin pamọ ni profaili olumulo','When enabled, users cannot see or change color scheme settings in their profile. Role-based settings will be applied.'=>'Nigbati o ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn olumulo ko le rii tabi yi awọn eto awọ pada ni profaili wọn. Awọn eto ti o da lori ipa yoo wa ni lilo.','Force role settings (override user selection)'=>'Ṣe agbara awọn eto ipa (bọsipọ yiyan olumulo)','When enabled, role settings will always apply, overriding any user selection even if the color scheme UI is visible to them.'=>'Nigbati o ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn eto ipa yoo ma lo nigbagbogbo, bọsipọ eyikeyi yiyan olumulo paapaa ti UI awọ ba han si wọn.','Admin Styles allows you to customize the WordPress admin area with your own branding.'=>'Awọn aṣa Admin gba ọ laaye lati ṣe adani agbegbe admin WordPress pẹlu ami rẹ.','Custom admin color schemes'=>'Awọn aṣa awọ adani admin','Replace the WordPress logo and favicon'=>'Rọpo aami WordPress ati favicon','Custom footer text'=>'Iwe Ara ẹsẹ adani','Replace "Howdy" text'=>'Rọpo ọrọ "Howdy"','How to use Admin Styles'=>'Bawo ni lati lo Awọn aṣa Admin','Security check failed.'=>'Iṣayẹwo aabo kuna.','You do not have permission to manage admin styles.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn aṣa admin.','No role specified.'=>'Ko si ipa ti a sọ.','Use this Image'=>'Lo Aworan yii','Saving...'=>'Fipamọ...','Settings saved.'=>'Awọn eto ti fipamọ.','Current logo preview'=>'Iṣafihan aami lọwọlọwọ','Add New Custom Style'=>'Fi Ara Adani Tuntun kun','Edit Custom Style'=>'Ṣatunkọ Àṣà Àdàkọ','Are you sure you want to delete "%s" custom style?'=>'Ṣe o dájú pé o fẹ pa "%s" àṣà àdàkọ?','this custom style'=>'àṣà àdàkọ yii','Primary Button'=>'Bọtini Pataki','Hover State'=>'Ipo Hover','Notification'=>'Ìkìlọ̀','Live preview of your custom color scheme'=>'Àfihàn laaye ti ẹ̀ka awọ rẹ','Custom Style Na