>'Ìjápọ Widget','Widget Link Hover'=>'Ìjápọ Widget nigba ti a ba kọja','Advanced'=>'Tilẹ','Custom selector color rules'=>'Awọn ofin awọ aṣayan aṣa','Classic Editor %s Restrictions'=>'Iwọn Iṣakoso Ẹrọ Iṣakoso %s','Select all %s editor restrictions'=>'Yan gbogbo %s awọn ihamọ olootu','No metaboxes found for %1s. %2s Click here %3s to visit the %4s screen and refresh this page afterwards to load the new metaboxes.'=>'Ko si awọn metaboxes ti a rii fun %1s. %2s Tẹ nibi %3s lati ṣabẹwo si iboju %4s ki o si tun ṣe oju-iwe yii lẹẹkansi lati gba awọn metaboxes tuntun.','Gutenberg Editor %s Restrictions'=>'Iwọn Iṣakoso Ẹrọ Gutenberg %s','Editor Feature Restrictions'=>'Iwọn Iṣakoso Iwọn Ẹrọ','Save for all Post Types'=>'Fipamọ fun gbogbo Awọn Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Save %s Restrictions'=>'Fipamọ %s Awọn ihamọ','Gutenberg'=>'Gutenberg','Classic'=>'Tilẹ','show Classic Editor controls'=>'fi han awọn iṣakoso Ẹrọ Tilẹ','Editor Features allows you to remove elements from the post editing screen.'=>'Awọn ẹya Ẹlẹda gba ọ laaye lati yọ awọn eroja kuro ninu iboju ṣiṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ.','How to use Editor Features'=>'Bawo ni a ṣe le lo Awọn ẹya Ẹlẹda','You do not have permission to manage frontend features.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣakoso awọn ẹya iwaju.','All fields are required.'=>'Gbogbo awọn agbegbe nilo.','Load on page types is required.'=>'Ikọkọ lori awọn iru oju-iwe jẹ dandan.','Frontend element item updated. Save changes to enable for role.'=>'Ero ohun iwaju ti a ṣe imudojuiwọn. Fipamọ awọn ayipada lati mu ṣiṣẹ fun ipa.','New frontend element added. Save changes to enable for role.'=>'Ero ohun iwaju tuntun ti a fi kun. Fipamọ awọn ayipada lati mu ṣiṣẹ fun ipa.','Invalid request!.'=>'Beere ti ko tọ!.','Selected item deleted successfully'=>'Ẹya ti a yan ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri','Site Dark Mode'=>'Ipo Dudu Aaye','Site Light Mode'=>'Ipo Imọlẹ Aaye','Hide Twenty Twenty-Three Credit Footer'=>'Pa Iwe-ẹri Twenty Twenty-Three silẹ','Frontend Features'=>'Awọn ẹya iwaju','Choose Frontend Features that will apply to this post.'=>'Yan Awọn ẹya iwaju ti yoo ṣee lo si ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Select %1$s'=>'Yan %1$s','Select %1$s...'=>'Yan %1$s...','This feature allows you to modify the site frontend by hiding IDs or classes, adding CSS styles, or adding body classes.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣe atunṣe iwaju aaye nipa fifi awọn ID tabi awọn kilasi pamọ, fifi awọn aṣa CSS kun, tabi fifi awọn kilasi ara kun.','Editing:'=>'Ṣiṣatunkọ:','Title:'=>'Ak title:','Title'=>'Ak title','This will only show here in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Eyi yoo han nibi nikan ni agbegbe admin WordPress.','Features:'=>'Awọn ẹya:','Hide IDs or Classes'=>'Pa awọn ID tabi Awọn Kilasi','Add Custom CSS'=>'Fi CSS aṣa kun','Add Body Class'=>'Fi Kilasi Ara kun','IDs or classes to hide'=>'Awọn ID tabi awọn kilasi lati pa','Enter IDs or classes to hide. Separate multiple values with a comma (.custom-item-one, .custom-item-two, #new-item-id).'=>'Tẹ awọn ID tabi awọn kilasi lati pa. Ya awọn iye pupọ pẹlu koma (.custom-item-one, .custom-item-two, #new-item-id).','Custom CSS'=>'CSS aṣa','Enter custom CSS to be added to frontend pages. Examples: .custom-style-1 { color: red; } #custom-header { background: red; } '=>'Tẹ CSS aṣa lati fi kun si awọn oju-iwe iwaju. Awọn apẹẹrẹ: .custom-style-1 { color: red; } #custom-header { background: red; } ','Body classes'=>'Awọn kilasi ara','Enter classes to add the body HTML. Do not include the . before the HTML.'=>'Tẹ awọn kilasi lati fi kun si HTML ara. Maṣe pẹlu . ṣaaju HTML.','Separate multiple values with a space (custom-style-one custom-style-two).'=>'Ya awọn iye pupọ pẹlu aaye (custom-style-one custom-style-two).','You can add the CSS for your classes by clicking "Add Custom CSS".'=>'O le fi CSS fun awọn kilasi rẹ kun nipa titẹ "Fi CSS aṣa kun".','Enter classes that should be added to the body HTML. Separate multiple values with a space (custom-item-one custom-item-two).'=>'Tẹ awọn kilasi ti o yẹ ki o fi kun si HTML ara. Ya awọn iye pupọ pẹlu aaye (custom-item-one custom-item-two).','Load on page types:'=>'Ikọkọ lori awọn iru oju-iwe:','Whole Site'=>'Gbogbo Aaye','Selected Pages'=>'Awọn Oju-iwe Ti a Yan','This feature will be added to all pages.'=>'Ẹya yii yoo fi kun si gbogbo awọn oju-iwe.','Add post metabox:'=>'Fi metabox ifiweranṣẹ kun:','Cancel Edit'=>'Fagilee Ṣiṣatunkọ','Add New'=>'Ṣe afikun Tuntun','Save Edit'=>'Fipamọ Àtúnṣe','Hidden IDs or Classes'=>'IDs tabi Kilasi Ti a Tọju','Body Class'=>'Kilasi Ara','Post Type Metabox'=>'Post Type Metabox','Role'=>'Iṣẹ','Enable Frontend Features for %1$s Role'=>'Mu awọn ẹya Frontend ṣiṣẹ fun %1$s Iṣẹ','Frontend Features allows you to add or remove elements from the frontend of your site.'=>'Awọn ẹya Frontend n gba ọ laaye lati fi tabi yọ awọn eroja kuro ni iwaju aaye rẹ.','Apply custom styling'=>'Lo aṣa aṣa','How to use Frontend Features'=>'Bawo ni lati lo Awọn ẹya Frontend','Navigation Menu Restrictions'=>'Iwọn Ibi Isopọ Irin-ajo','There are no frontend menu links. To control access to navigation menus, please add menu links.'=>'Ko si awọn ọna asopọ akojọ irin-ajo iwaju. Lati ṣakoso iraye si awọn akojọ irin-ajo, jọwọ fi awọn ọna asopọ akojọ kun.','Navigation Menus allows you to block access to frontend menu links.'=>'Awọn Akojọ Irin-ajo n gba ọ laaye lati dina iraye si awọn ọna asopọ akojọ irin-ajo iwaju.','How to use Navigation Menus'=>'Bawo ni lati lo Awọn Akojọ Irin-ajo','Profile Feature Restrictions'=>'Iwọn Ibi Awọn ẹya Profaili','Click the "Find profile items for this role" button.'=>'Tẹ bọtini "Wa awọn nkan profaili fun iṣẹ yii".','There are no users in this role. Please select a role that has users and is able to access the "Profile" screen.'=>'Ko si awọn olumulo ni iṣẹ yii. Jọwọ yan iṣẹ ti o ni awọn olumulo ati pe o le wọle si iboju "Profaili".','Allow PublishPress to find profile items for this role.'=>'Gba PublishPress laaye lati wa awọn nkan profaili fun iṣẹ yii.','Find profile items for this role'=>'Wa awọn nkan profaili fun iṣẹ yii','The %s role is not enabled for editing. The Find button is disabled.'=>'Iṣẹ %s ko ni imudojuiwọn fun àtúnṣe. Bọtini Wa ti wa ni pipade.','This feature will test the "Profile" screen as a user in the %s role.'=>'Iwọn yii yoo danwo iboju "Profaili" gẹgẹbi olumulo ni iṣẹ %s.','Refresh Profile Features'=>'Tun ṣe Awọn ẹya Profaili','Profile Features allows you to remove elements from the Profile screen.'=>'Awọn ẹya Profaili n gba ọ laaye lati yọ awọn eroja kuro ni iboju Profaili.','How to use Profile Features'=>'Bawo ni lati lo Awọn ẹya Profaili','Hide Default Items'=>'Tọju Awọn nkan Aiyipada','Hide Admin Toolbar'=>'Tọju Toolbar Admin','Hide Dashboard Widgets'=>'Tọju Awọn Widget Dashboard','Mobile Menu Toggle'=>'Tan Kaadi Akojọ Alagbeka','WordPress Logo'=>'WordPress Logo','WordPress External Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Ita WordPress','Right bar'=>'Apa otun','User actions'=>'Iṣe olumulo','New'=>'Tuntun','User Display Name'=>'Orukọ Ifihan Olumulo','Yoast SEO'=>'Yoast SEO','Edit Post'=>'Ṣatunkọ Ifiweranṣẹ','Edit Site'=>'Ṣatunkọ Aaye','Thank you for creating with WordPress'=>'O ṣeun fun ṣiṣẹda pẹlu WordPress','Welcome panel'=>'Panẹli Ikini','Remove Admin Toolbar'=>'Yọ Toolbar Admin','Top Tabs'=>'Top Tabs','Slug'=>'Slug','Media Buttons (all)'=>'Media Buttons (all)','HTML Editor Button'=>'HTML Editor Button','Word count'=>'Word count','Publish Box'=>'Publish Box','Publish Actions'=>'Publish Actions','Taxonomy Boxes'=>'Taxonomy Boxes','Page Boxes'=>'Page Boxes','Other Boxes'=>'Other Boxes','Featured Image'=>'Featured Image','Coupon Description'=>'Coupon Description','Top Bar - Left'=>'Top Bar - Left','Add block'=>'Add block','Modes'=>'Modes','Outline'=>'Outline','Document Overview'=>'Document Overview','Document Bar Title'=>'Document Bar Title','Top Bar - Right'=>'Top Bar - Right','Switch to Draft'=>'Switch to Draft','Publish / Update'=>'Publish / Update','Options'=>'Options','Body'=>'Body','Add new block'=>'Add new block','Document Panel'=>'Document Panel','Settings Panel'=>'Settings Panel','Status & visibility'=>'Status & visibility','Permalink'=>'Permalink','Featured image'=>'Featured image','Post Attributes'=>'Post Attributes','Block Panel'=>'Block Panel','Paragraph'=>'Paragraph','Typography'=>'Typography','Color settings'=>'Color settings','Text settings'=>'Text settings','This role is not enabled for profile feature editing.'=>'This role is not enabled for profile feature editing.','An error occurred!'=>'An error occurred!','Profile features access disabled.'=>'Profile features access disabled.','Invalid role provided.'=>'Invalid role provided.','Profile features access enabled for this role.'=>'Profile features access enabled for this role.','Editor Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Ẹlẹda','Admin Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Alakoso','Profile Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Profaili','Redirects'=>'Awọn atunṣe','Nav Menu'=>'Akopọ Iṣakoso','Application Password Capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo','Roles allows you to create, edit, and delete all the user roles on your site.'=>'Awọn ipa ngbanilaaye ki o ṣẹda, ṣatunkọ, ati paarẹ gbogbo awọn ipa olumulo lori aaye rẹ.','Capabilities allows you to change the permissions for any user role.'=>'Awọn agbara ngbanilaaye ki o yipada awọn iwe-aṣẹ fun eyikeyi ipa olumulo.','Admin Styles allows you to customize the admin area with your own branding.'=>'Awọn aṣa Alakoso ngbanilaaye ki o ṣe aṣa agbegbe alakoso pẹlu ami rẹ.','Redirects allows you to redirect users in a role after Registration, Login or Logout.'=>'Awọn atunṣe ngbanilaaye ki o yipada awọn olumulo ni ipa lẹhin Ideri, Wọle tabi Jade.','Navigation Menus'=>'Awọn akojọ aṣayan Iṣakoso','User Testing'=>'Iwadi Olumulo','Test your site by instantly logging in as another user. Available accounts include any which the current user can edit.'=>'Ṣayẹwo aaye rẹ nipa wiwo bi olumulo miiran. Awọn iroyin to wa pẹlu eyikeyi ti olumulo lọwọlọwọ le ṣatunkọ.','Remove Admin Notices from WordPress admin screen and organize them in to a single area.'=>'Yọ awọn ifitonileti Alakoso kuro ni iboju alakoso WordPress ki o ṣeto wọn sinu agbegbe kan.','Login permission denied.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ wiwọle ti kọ.','Need PublishPress Capabilities Support?'=>'Nilo Atilẹyin Awọn agbara PublishPress?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jẹ ki a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe aṣẹ alaye tun wa lori oju opo wẹẹbu afikun.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo ipilẹ Imọ','Social Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Awujọ','Page Lists'=>'Awọn atokọ Oju-iwe','New role created.'=>'Ipa tuntun ti ṣẹda.','Error: Failed creating the new role.'=>'Aṣiṣe: Kọlu lati ṣẹda ipa tuntun.','The selected role is not editable.'=>'Ipa ti a yan ko le ṣatunkọ.','Incorrect capability name.'=>'Orukọ agbara ti ko tọ.','Type / Taxonomy settings saved.'=>'Iru / Awọn eto Taxonomy ti fipamọ.','Bad form received.'=>'Fọọmu buburu ti gba.','You cannot remove Manage Capabilities from Administrators'=>'O ko le yọ Awọn agbara Isakoso kuro lati awọn Alakoso','The selected application password is not editable.'=>'Ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo ti a yan ko le ṣatunkọ.','Application password capabilities saved.'=>'Awọn agbara ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo ti fipamọ.','Network synchronization requires a main-site network administrator.'=>'Iṣakoso nẹtiwọọki nilo alakoso nẹtiwọọki aaye akọkọ.','Choose an existing role and a synchronization operation.'=>'Yan ipa to wa tẹlẹ ati iṣẹ iṣọpọ.','This capability is explicitly negated. Click to add/remove normally.'=>'Agbara yii ti kọ ni kedere. Tẹ lati ṣafikun/yọkuro ni deede.','Explicity negate this capability by storing as disabled'=>'Kedere kọ agbara yii nipa fipamọ bi a ti pa','Explicitly negate these capabilities by storing as disabled'=>'Kedere kọ awọn agbara wọnyi nipa fipamọ bi a ti pa','Post type registration does not define this capability distinctly'=>'Iforukọsilẹ iru ifiweranṣẹ ko ṣe alaye agbara yii ni kedere','Add or remove this capability from the WordPress role'=>'Ṣafikun tabi yọ agbara yii kuro ni ipa WordPress','Add or remove capability from the role normally'=>'Ṣafikun tabi yọ agbara kuro ni ipa ni deede','Are you sure you want to delete this item ?'=>'Ṣe o da lori pe o fẹ paarẹ nkan yii?','Add or clear custom item entry before saving changes.'=>'Fi ẹyọ ohun ti a ṣe adani kun tabi nu ṣaaju ki o to fipamọ awọn ayipada.','Found %1$d match in %2$d tab'=>'A ri %1$d ibamu ninu %2$d taabu','Found %1$d match in %2$d tabs'=>'A ri %1$d ibamu ninu %2$d awọn taabu','Found %1$d matches in %2$d tab'=>'A ri %1$d awọn ibamu ninu %2$d taabu','Found %1$d matches in %2$d tabs'=>'A ri %1$d awọn ibamu ninu %2$d awọn taabu','No matches found for "%s"'=>'Ko si awọn ibamu ti a ri fun "%s"','Select all roles'=>'Yan gbogbo awọn ipa','Role Name'=>'Orukọ Ipa','Role Type'=>'Iru Ipa','Default Role'=>'Ipa Aiyipada','Admin Access'=>'Iwọle Alakoso','You do not have permission to manage roles.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn ipa.','You do not have permission to manage editor features.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn ẹya olootu.','You do not have permission to manage admin features.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn ẹya alakoso.','You do not have permission to manage navigation menus.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn akojọ aṣayan lilọ kiri.','You do not have permission to manage profile features.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn ẹya profaili.','You do not have permission to manage redirect.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso atunṣe.','Invalid form. Reload this page and try again.'=>'Fọọmu ti ko tọ. Tun oju-iwe yii gbe ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','You do not have permission to manage capabilities.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn agbara.','Network sync completed.'=>'Isopọ nẹtiwọọki ti pari.','Network sync has been queued and will continue in the background.'=>'Isopọ nẹtiwọọki ti wa ni ipo ati pe yoo tẹsiwaju ni abẹlẹ.','New capability added to role.'=>'Agbara tuntun ti a fi kun si ipa.','Bad form Received'=>'Fọọmu ti ko dara ti gba','You do not have permission to restore roles.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati tun awọn ipa ṣe.','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣe iṣe yii.','Select at least one role to export.'=>'Yan o kere ju ipa kan lati gbe jade.','There are no users in this role on this site. Add a user to this role, then find profile items again.'=>'Ko si awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii lori aaye yii. Fi olumulo kan kun si ipa yii, lẹhinna wa awọn ohun profaili lẹẹkansi.','Profile items could not be detected because User Testing is disabled, you cannot test the user in this role, or the user cannot access the Profile screen.'=>'A ko le ṣe awari awọn ohun profaili nitori Idanwo Olumulo wa ni pipade, o ko le ṣe idanwo olumulo ni ipa yii, tabi olumulo ko le wọle si iboju Profaili.','Profile items could not be detected because users in this role are blocked from the admin area by the Block Dashboard Access option.'=>'A ko le ṣe awari awọn ohun profaili nitori awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii ti wa ni idinamọ lati agbegbe alakoso nipasẹ aṣayan Idina Wọle si Dashboard.','If you like %s, please leave us a %s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ %s, jọwọ fi wa silẹ ni %s ìkànsí. O ṣeun!','About PublishPress Capabilities'=>'Nipa Awọn Agbara PublishPress','About'=>'Nipa','Capabilites Documentation'=>'Iwe Itọsọna Awọn Agbara','Documentation'=>'Iwe Itọsọna','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'Kan si ẹgbẹ PublishPress','Contact'=>'Kan si','Use the exact input types shown in discovery.'=>'Lo awọn iru iwọle ti o pe ni a fihan ninu awari.','List capabilities'=>'Atokọ awọn agbara','List known role, post-type and taxonomy capabilities, optionally filtered by name.'=>'Atokọ ipa ti a mọ, post-type ati awọn agbara taxonomy, ti a le fa nipasẹ orukọ.','Compare roles'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn ipa','Compare stored role grants and denials. Null means a capability is absent, false means explicitly denied.'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn ikọkọ ti a fipamọ ati awọn ikọkọ ti a kọ. Ko si tumo si pe agbara kan wa, iro tumo si pe a kọ ni kedere.','Create role'=>'Ṣẹda ipa','Create an empty role or copy capabilities from source_role. Does not overwrite an existing role. Use update-role-capabilities for grants. MCP refuses copying administrator-level capabilities.'=>'Ṣẹda ipa ofo tabi da awọn agbara pada lati source_role. Ko ṣe atunṣe ipa ti o wa. Lo update-role-capabilities fun awọn ikọkọ. MCP kọ lati da awọn agbara ipele alakoso pada.','Rename role'=>'Tun orukọ ipa','Change a role display name while retaining its slug, users, settings and capabilities.'=>'Yipada orukọ ifihan ipa nigba ti o pa slug rẹ, awọn olumulo, awọn eto ati awọn agbara rẹ mọ.','Delete role'=>'Pa ipa','Delete a custom editable role. Existing users with no remaining role move to the site default. System/default/own roles are protected.'=>'Pa ipa ti a le satunkọ. Awọn olumulo ti o wa ti ko ni ipa ti o ku gbe lọ si aiyipada aaye. Awọn ipa eto / aiyipada / tirẹ ni a daabobo.','Update role capabilities'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn agbara ipa','Patch capabilities: grant=true, deny=false, remove=unset. Unmentioned capabilities remain unchanged. Use dry_run to inspect before/after without saving. Changes are validated before writes. MCP refuses new administrator-level grants, including in dry runs.'=>'Patch awọn agbara: grant=true, deny=false, remove=unset. Awọn agbara ti a ko mẹnuba ko yipada. Lo dry_run lati ṣe ayẹwo ṣaaju / lẹhin laisi fipamọ. Awọn ayipada ni a fọwọsi ṣaaju ki o to kọ. MCP kọ awọn ikọkọ ipele alakoso tuntun, pẹlu ninu awọn ṣiṣe gbigbẹ.','Get role options'=>'Gba awọn aṣayan ipa','Read role editor preference, login/dashboard access and assignment disabling settings.'=>'Ka awọn ayanfẹ olootu ipa, wiwọle/login/dashboard ati awọn eto idinamọ assignment.','Update role options'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn aṣayan ipa','Patch role options without changing capabilities. Administrator/default/own-role lockout protections apply.'=>'Patch awọn aṣayan ipa laisi yipada awọn agbara. Awọn aabo ipari alakoso / aiyipada / ipa tirẹ ko lo.','List features'=>'Atokọ awọn ẹya','Discover all Capabilities menus, enabled states, permission names and supported configuration fields.'=>'Ṣawari gbogbo awọn akojọpọ agbara, awọn ipo ti a mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn orukọ aṣẹ ati awọn aaye iṣeto ti a ṣe atilẹyin.','Set feature enabled'=>'Seto ẹya ti a mu ṣiṣẹ','Enable or disable a Capabilities dashboard feature on this site. Disabled features reject their configuration actions.'=>'Mu ṣiṣẹ tabi pa ẹya akojọpọ dashboard ni aaye yii. Awọn ẹya ti a pa ko gba awọn iṣe iṣeto wọn.','Get feature choices'=>'Gba awọn aṣayan ẹya','Discover existing editor/admin elements, captured profile/frontend elements, menu snapshots with exact restriction_value identifiers, navigation items or admin style templates. Does not capture new browser UI.'=>'Ṣawari awọn eroja olootu / alakoso ti o wa, awọn eroja profaili / iwaju ti a mu, awọn aworan akojọ pẹlu awọn idanimọ restriction_value gangan, awọn nkan lilọ kiri tabi awọn awoṣe ara alakoso. Ko gba UI aṣawakiri tuntun.','Get feature settings'=>'Gba awọn eto ẹya','Read a role\'s settings for an enabled feature. Editor restrictions are specific to post_type and editor. Navigation also supports ppc_guest and ppc_users.'=>'Ka awọn eto ipa\'s fun ẹya ti a mu ṣiṣẹ. Awọn ihamọ olootu jẹ pataki si post_type ati olootu. Lilọ kiri tun ṣe atilẹyin ppc_guest ati ppc_users.','Update feature settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto ẹya','Patch feature settings for one role. List fields replace their lists; unmentioned fields and other roles remain unchanged. dry_run validates and returns proposed values without saving. Discover fields with list-features. For admin-menus, first get-feature-choices and use discovery restriction_value identifiers. New unknown menu identifiers are rejected.'=>'Patch awọn eto ẹya fun ipa kan. Atokọ awọn aaye rọpo atokọ wọn; awọn aaye ti a ko mẹnuba ati awọn ipa miiran ko yipada. dry_run n fọwọsi ati pada awọn iye ti a dabaa laisi fipamọ. Ṣawari awọn aaye pẹlu list-features. Fun awọn akojọ aṣayan alakoso, akọkọ gba-feature-choices ki o lo awọn idanimọ restriction_value. Awọn idanimọ akojọ tuntun ti a ko mọ ni a kọ.','Bulk update feature settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto ẹya ni apapọ','Apply the same feature settings to multiple roles, validating all targets before writing. dry_run returns proposed settings only.'=>'Lo awọn eto ẹya kanna si ọpọlọpọ awọn ipa, fọwọsi gbogbo awọn ibi-afẹde ṣaaju ki o to kọ. dry_run n pada awọn eto ti a dabaa nikan.','Get plugin settings'=>'Gba awọn eto plugin','Read Capabilities > Settings and the supported setting descriptions. Includes Roles > Multiples roles on Add New User and User Edit (Edit User), Editor Features > Show private post types, Capabilities visibility, User Testing, Admin Menus and Pro settings.'=>'Ka Awọn Agbara > Awọn eto ati awọn apejuwe eto ti a ṣe atilẹyin. Pẹlu Awọn ipa > Awọn ipa pupọ lori Fi olumulo tuntun kun ati Ṣatunkọ olumulo (Ṣatunkọ olumulo), Awọn ẹya olootu > Fihan awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ikọkọ, Iṣafihan awọn agbara, Igbeyewo olumulo, Awọn akojọ aṣayan alakoso ati Awọn eto Pro.','Update plugin settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto plugin','Enable, disable or update Capabilities > Settings options. Supports multiple roles on Add New User or User Edit (Edit User), Show private post types under Editor Features or Capabilities, User Testing and Admin Menus settings. Read get-plugin-settings to identify the exact field. Change only the requested field. This saves individual settings, unlike set-feature-enabled which toggles whole screens.'=>'Mu ṣiṣẹ, pa tabi ṣatunkọ Awọn Agbara > Awọn aṣayan eto. Ṣe atilẹyin ọpọlọpọ awọn ipa lori Fi olumulo tuntun kun tabi Ṣatunkọ olumulo (Ṣatunkọ olumulo), Fihan awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ikọkọ labẹ Awọn ẹya olootu tabi Awọn agbara, Igbeyewo olumulo ati awọn eto akojọ aṣayan alakoso. Ka gba-plugin-settings lati ṣe idanimọ aaye gangan. Yipada nikan aaye ti a beere. Eyi fipamọ awọn eto kọọkan, kii ṣe set-feature-enabled ti o yi gbogbo awọn iboju pada.','List backups'=>'Atokọ awọn afẹyinti','List saved manual, initial and automatic Capabilities role backups. Returns identifiers for restore-backup.'=>'Atokọ awọn afẹyinti ipa agbara ti a fipamọ, ibẹrẹ ati aifọwọyi. Pada awọn idanimọ fun atunto-afẹyinti.','Create backup'=>'Ṣẹda afẹyinti','Save the current roles and plugin feature settings using the existing manual backup format. Replaces the last manual backup.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ipa lọwọlọwọ ati awọn eto ẹya plugin nipa lilo ọna kika afẹyinti manual ti o wa. Rọpo afẹyinti manual ikẹhin.','Restore backup'=>'Tun afẹyinti','Restore a listed backup. Manual backups include feature settings; initial/automatic backups restore roles. Use dry_run before applying.'=>'Tun afẹyinti ti a atokọ. Awọn afẹyinti manual pẹlu awọn eto ẹya; awọn afẹyinti ibẹrẹ / aifọwọyi tun awọn ipa. Lo dry_run ṣaaju ki o to lo.','Export configuration'=>'Gba iṣeto','Export plugin-owned configuration in the same allowlisted format used by the Backup screen. Returns available_sections for selective export and optionally filters user_roles by role slug. Contains permission configuration, not password secrets.'=>'Gba iṣeto ti plugin ti o ni ni ọna kika ti a gba laaye ti a lo nipasẹ iboju Afẹyinti. Pada available_sections fun gbigbe lọ silẹ ati ni yiyan ṣe àlẹmọ awọn olumulo_roles nipasẹ slug ipa. Ni awọn iṣeto aṣẹ, kii ṣe awọn aṣiri ọrọ igbaniwọle.','Import configuration'=>'Gbe iṣeto','Validate and import a configuration export using the existing backup validators. Reject unsupported entries before writing; dry_run validates without saving. MCP rejects new administrator-level grants.'=>'Fọwọsi ati gbe iṣeto gbigbe kan nipa lilo awọn ayẹwo afẹyinti ti o wa. Kọ awọn titẹ sii ti a ko ṣe atilẹyin ṣaaju ki o to kọ; dry_run n fọwọsi laisi fipamọ. MCP kọ awọn ikọkọ ipele alakoso tuntun.','Save interface element'=>'Fipamọ eroja wiwo','Create or update a profile selector or frontend selector/CSS/body-class element. Does not enable it for a role; use update-feature-settings afterwards.'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn oluyẹwo profaili tabi oluyẹwo iwaju/ CSS/ ara-kilasi. Kii ṣe mu u ṣiṣẹ fun ipa; lo imudojuiwọn- ẹya-eto lẹhinna.','Delete interface element'=>'Pa ohun elo wiwo','Delete a profile/frontend element and remove its saved restriction references.'=>'Pa ohun elo profaili/ iwaju kan ki o yọ awọn itọkasi ihamọ ti a fipamọ rẹ.','Update admin menu presentation'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn ifihan akojọ aṣayan admin','Rename menus for a role, set global menu/submenu ordering, update menu UI settings, or reset custom presentation. This does not change capabilities.'=>'Tun orukọ awọn akojọ fun ipa, ṣeto akojọ gbogbogbo/ akojọ-kekere, ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn eto UI akojọ, tabi tunṣe ifihan aṣa. Eyi ko yipada awọn agbara.','Save admin style'=>'Fipamọ aṣa admin','Create/update a named custom admin color style using existing sanitizers and CSS generation. Free supports one custom style; Pro supports multiple.'=>'Ṣẹda/ṣe imudojuiwọn aṣa awọ admin ti a fun ni orukọ nipa lilo awọn sanitizers ti o wa tẹlẹ ati irọrun CSS. Free n ṣe atilẹyin aṣa aṣa kan; Pro n ṣe atilẹyin pupọ.','Delete admin style'=>'Pa aṣa admin','Delete a custom admin style and its generated CSS. Roles using it return to the default color scheme.'=>'Pa aṣa admin aṣa kan ati CSS ti a ṣe. Awọn ipa ti o nlo rẹ pada si akosile awọ aiyipada.','List application password scopes'=>'Atokọ awọn iwọn ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo','List manageable application password names and denied capabilities. Returns no plaintext passwords or hashes. Requires the application-password capabilities feature to be enabled.'=>'Atokọ awọn orukọ ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo ti o le ṣakoso ati awọn agbara ti a kọ. Kii ṣe pada awọn ọrọigbaniwọle tabi hashes plaintext. Nilo ẹya agbara-ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo lati wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ.','Update application password scope'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn iwọn ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo','Replace the denied capability list for one application password. Restrictions only reduce its user\'s capabilities; they do not grant privileges.'=>'Rọpo atokọ agbara ti a kọ fun ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo kan. Awọn ihamọ nikan dinku awọn agbara olumulo rẹ; wọn ko fun awọn anfaani.','Update user roles'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn ipa olumulo','Replace an existing site user\'s assigned roles using the profile form rules. Requires multiple-role editing to be enabled, preserves forum roles, and supports dry_run. Newly assigned administrator-level roles are refused by MCP.'=>'Rọpo awọn ipa ti a yàn fun olumulo aaye ti o wa tẹlẹ nipa lilo awọn ofin fọọmu profaili. Nilo ṣiṣatunkọ ipa pupọ lati wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ, pa awọn ipa forum mọ, ati ṣe atilẹyin dry_run. Awọn ipa iṣakoso ti a yàn tuntun ni a kọ nipasẹ MCP.','Get user capabilities'=>'Gba awọn agbara olumulo','Inspect a site member\'s roles and effective capability values, as on the User Capabilities screen. No identity switching or user changes.'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn ipa ọmọ ẹgbẹ aaye ati awọn iye agbara ti o munadoko, gẹgẹ bi lori iboju Agbara Olumulo. Kii ṣe iyipada idanimọ tabi awọn ayipada olumulo.','Check user capability'=>'Ṣayẹwo agbara olumulo','Test a user\'s effective permission, optionally for an object ID. Applies WordPress permission filters without impersonating that user or changing the MCP session.'=>'Testi igbanilaaye ti o munadoko ti olumulo, pẹlu aṣayan fun ID ohun kan. Nlo awọn filasi igbanilaaye WordPress laisi ṣiṣe afiwe olumulo yẹn tabi yipada akoko MCP.','Choose an editable role for profile capture.'=>'Yan ipa ti a le satunkọ fun gbigba profaili.','A post type or taxonomy does not exist.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ tabi taxonomy ko si.','Post not found.'=>'Kọkọ ko ri.','A frontend element does not exist.'=>'Ohun elo iwaju ko si.','Invalid menu slug.'=>'Slug akojọ ti ko tọ.','Custom menu not found.'=>'Akojọ aṣa ko ri.','Title, capability and submenu parent are required.'=>'Akọle, agbara ati obi akojọ-kekere ni a nilo.','Unsupported menu URL.'=>'URL akojọ ti ko ni atilẹyin.','Prepare profile capture'=>'Ṣeto gbigba profaili','Enable/disable the existing five-minute profile capture window and return the admin page to visit. Actual DOM capture runs in the browser with its own authenticated session.'=>'Mu ki/pa window gbigba profaili iṣẹju marun ti o wa tẹlẹ ṣiṣẹ ati pada oju-iwe admin lati ṣabẹwo. Gbigba DOM gangan n ṣiṣẹ ninu aṣawakiri pẹlu akoko ti a fọwọsi tirẹ.','Update admin feature UI settings'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn eto UI ẹya admin','Set the Admin Features hide-submenu preference. This is a global presentation preference, not a role access rule.'=>'Ṣeto ayanfẹ ikọkọ akojọ aṣayan Admin. Eyi jẹ ayanfẹ ifihan gbogbogbo, kii ṣe ofin iwọle ipa.','Get type capability settings'=>'Gba awọn eto agbara iru','Read type-specific post/taxonomy capability mappings and discover registered types.'=>'Ka awọn maapu agbara ifiweranṣẹ/taxonomy pato iru ki o si ṣe awari awọn iru ti a forukọsilẹ.','Update type capability settings'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn eto agbara iru','Patch type-specific capabilities and detailed taxonomy mapping. Detailed taxonomies also enable type-specific capabilities. Takes effect on the next request.'=>'Patch awọn agbara pato iru ati maapu taxonomy alaye. Awọn taxonomy alaye tun mu awọn agbara pato iru ṣiṣẹ. Mu ipa ni ibeere ti n bọ.','Set role level'=>'Ṣeto ipele ipa','Set a legacy WordPress role level from 0 to 10. Administrator stays at level 10. dry_run previews capability changes.'=>'Ṣeto ipele ipa WordPress atijọ lati 0 si 10. Alakoso duro ni ipele 10. dry_run fihan awọn ayipada agbara.','Reset roles'=>'Tun awọn ipa ṣe','Role reset requires the native Backup screen. MCP refuses recovery hooks that could introduce administrator-level grants.'=>'Itonisọna ipa nilo iboju Backup abinibi. MCP kọ awọn asopọ gbigba ti o le mu awọn ẹbun ipele alakoso wa.','Test user access'=>'Testi iwọle olumulo','Test an eligible user’s permission through the User Testing access rules without switching cookies or the MCP identity.'=>'Ṣe idanwo aṣẹ olumulo ti o yẹ nipasẹ awọn ofin iraye si Iwadi Olumulo laisi iyipada kuki tabi idanimọ MCP.','Sync role network'=>'Sopọ nẹtiwọọki ipa','Queue the existing role/capability and option synchronization across network sites. Requires a main-site network administrator. MCP refuses synchronization of roles with administrator-level capabilities.'=>'Queue ipa/agbega ti o wa ati iṣọpọ aṣayan kọja awọn aaye nẹtiwọọki. Nilo alakoso nẹtiwọọki aaye akọkọ. MCP kọ iṣọpọ awọn ipa pẹlu awọn agbara ipele alakoso.','Get post frontend elements'=>'Gba awọn eroja iwaju ifiweranṣẹ','Read a post’s frontend element overrides (Pro), respecting edit_post permission.'=>'Ka awọn iyipada eroja iwaju ifiweranṣẹ (Pro), ni احترام aṣẹ edit_post.','Set post frontend elements'=>'Ṣeto awọn eroja iwaju ifiweranṣẹ','Replace a post’s enabled frontend element overrides (Pro). Empty list clears them.'=>'Rọpo awọn iyipada eroja iwaju ifiweranṣẹ ti a mu ṣiṣẹ (Pro). Atokọ ofo nu wọn.','Manage custom admin menu'=>'Ṣakoso akojọ aṣayan adani','Create/update/delete a custom admin menu or separator (Pro). Menu data contains no executable callbacks. Refreshes menu snapshots.'=>'Ṣẹda/ṣe imudojuiwọn/pa akojọ aṣayan adani tabi idapọ (Pro). Data akojọ ko ni awọn ipe ti a le ṣe. Tun awọn aworan akojọ ṣe.','Choose section identifiers returned by export discovery.'=>'Yan awọn idanimọ apakan ti a pada nipasẹ iwadii ẹkọ.','Role selection requires the user_roles export section.'=>'Yiyan ipa nilo apakan gbigbe awọn olumulo_roles.','An export role does not exist.'=>'Ipa gbigbe ko si.','Choose a backup returned by list-backups.'=>'Yan ẹda afẹyinti ti a pada nipasẹ atokọ-afẹyinti.','Configuration contains an unsupported setting.'=>'Iṣeto naa ni eto ti a ko fẹsẹmulẹ.','Invalid role definitions.'=>'Awọn itumọ ipa ti ko tọ.','The administrator role must retain access to WordPress and Capabilities.'=>'Ipa alakoso gbọdọ pa aṣẹ si WordPress ati Awọn Agbara.','Imported roles must include the default role.'=>'Awọn ipa ti a gbe wọle gbọdọ pẹlu ipa aiyipada.','Invalid configuration value.'=>'Iye iṣeto ti ko tọ.','No configuration was supplied.'=>'Ko si iṣeto ti a pese.','Actions provided by PublishPress plugins.'=>'Awọn iṣe ti a pese nipasẹ awọn afikun PublishPress.','A label and selector or URL are required.'=>'Aami kan ati aṣayan tabi URL ni a nilo.','Custom rule not found.'=>'Ofin adani ko ri.','List custom rules'=>'Atokọ awọn ofin adani','List Pro custom editor selectors, hidden admin elements or blocked URLs, including the exact restriction values used by feature settings.'=>'Atokọ awọn olutọpa olootu adani Pro, awọn eroja alakoso ti a pa mọ tabi awọn URL ti a pa, pẹlu awọn iye ihamọ gangan ti a lo nipasẹ awọn eto ẹya.','Save custom rule'=>'Fipamọ ofin adani','Create/update a Pro custom editor selector, admin CSS hiding rule or blocked-URL rule. Save its restriction_value in the role feature settings to enable it.'=>'Ṣẹda/ṣe imudojuiwọn aṣayan olootu adani Pro, ofin ihamọ CSS alakoso tabi ofin URL ti a pa. Fipamọ restriction_value rẹ ninu awọn eto ẹya ipa lati mu ṣiṣẹ.','Delete custom rule'=>'Pa ofin adani','Delete a Pro custom restriction rule and its role restriction references.'=>'Pa ofin ihamọ adani Pro kan ati awọn itọkasi ihamọ ipa rẹ.','Unknown feature.'=>'Ẹya ti a ko mọ.','This post type is not available in Editor Features.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko si ni Awọn ẹya Olootu.','Role not found.'=>'Ipa ko ri.','The role is not editable.'=>'Ipa naa ko le ṣe atunṣe.','A profile element in the order does not exist.'=>'Elemento profaili kan ninu aṣẹ ko si.','Redirects must be valid URLs on this site.'=>'Awọn atunṣe gbọdọ jẹ awọn URL to wulo lori aaye yii.','Network synchronization requires the main-site network administrator.'=>'Iṣọpọ nẹtiwọki nilo alakoso nẹtiwọọki aaye akọkọ.','This feature cannot be toggled.'=>'Ẹya yii ko le yipada.','Admin Toolbar'=>'Ọpa Alakoso','Header and Footer'=>'Ori ati Ikẹhin','Dashboard widgets'=>'Awọn ohun elo dashboard','Choose an existing role to discover Profile Features.'=>'Yan ipa to wa lati ṣe awari Awọn ẹya Profaili.','Use restriction_value from the selected editor layout. Custom selectors and metaboxes require Pro and previously saved or captured data.'=>'Lo restriction_value lati inu àtúnṣe olùkà àtẹ̀jáde. Àwọn olùṣàkóso aṣa ati metaboxes nilo Pro ati data ti a fipamọ́ tàbí ti a gba tẹlẹ.','Use restriction_value for toolbar, header/footer and dashboard items. Visit the WordPress dashboard as an authorized administrator to refresh captured widgets and toolbar nodes.'=>'Lo restriction_value fún toolbar, akọsori/ìkànsí àti dashboard. Bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí WordPress dashboard gẹ́gẹ́ bí olùṣàkóso tó ni àṣẹ láti tún awọn widgets ati awọn nœd toolbar ti a gba àtọkànwá.','Profile choices belong to the selected role. If empty or incomplete, use prepare-profile-capture for that role and complete capture in the browser. Use each element restriction_value when saving disabled items.'=>'Àwọn yiyan profaili jẹ́ ti ipa ti a yan. Tí kò bá sí tàbí tí kò pé, lo prepare-profile-capture fún ipa yẹn àti pé àtọkànwá ní brawsà. Lo kọọkan èlémẹ́ntì restriction_value nígbà tí o bá n ṣàdédé àwọn nkan tí a ti pa.','These are saved frontend selectors, styles and body-class elements with their page and post-type scopes. Use restriction_value to select them. Use save-interface-element to create a missing element. Reading choices does not install demo elements.'=>'Ẹ̀wẹ̀, àwọn olùṣàkóso àtẹ̀jáde, awọn aza àti awọn èlémẹ́ntì body-class ni a fipamọ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn àgbègbè ojú-ìwé àti post-type wọn. Lo restriction_value láti yan wọn. Lo save-interface-element láti ṣẹda èlémẹ́ntì tí kò sí.','Notice types and toolbar access are configured with the fields below. Read actual per-role settings with get-feature-settings.'=>'Àwọn irú ìkìlọ̀ àti iraye si toolbar ti wa ni iṣeto pẹ̀lú àwọn àpoti ni isalẹ. Ka awọn eto gidi fun ipa kọọkan pẹ̀lú get-feature-settings.','Read actual per-role redirect targets with get-feature-settings. Use WordPress content lookup to resolve a destination rather than guessing a post ID.'=>'Ka awọn ibi àtúnṣe gidi fun ipa kọọkan pẹ̀lú get-feature-settings. Lo WordPress content lookup láti yan ibi-ìpinlẹ dipo àfojúsùn ID ìkànsí.','These are existing navigation menus and their items. Use their actual menu-item IDs when saving restrictions.'=>'Ẹ̀wẹ̀, àwọn akojọ ìrìnàjò to wà ati awọn nkan wọn. Lo ID àwọn nkan akojọ gidi wọn nígbà tí o bá n fipamọ́ àkópọ̀.','These are available templates, saved custom styles and color schemes. Read actual per-role style settings with get-feature-settings.'=>'Ẹ̀wẹ̀, àwọn àtẹ̀jáde ti o wa, awọn aza aṣa ti a fipamọ́ ati awọn àyípadà awọ. Ka awọn eto aza gidi fun ipa kọọkan pẹ̀lú get-feature-settings.','Use the menu discovery restriction values and refresh instructions.'=>'Lo awọn iye restriction discovery ti akojọ ati tun awọn ilana.','Editor Features > Show private post types. Display non-public post types in Editor Features. This does not change the Capabilities screen visibility setting.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ ẹya Olùkà > Ṣàfihàn awọn post type ikọkọ. Ṣàfihàn awọn post type ti kii ṣe àwùjọ ni Ẹ̀ya Olùkà. Eyi kò yipada àyípadà àpapọ́ iboju Capabilities.','Capabilities > Show private taxonomies. Include non-public taxonomies when editing role capabilities.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ya > Ṣàfihàn awọn taxonomies ikọkọ. Fi awọn taxonomies ti kii ṣe àwùjọ kun nígbà tí o bá n ṣatúnṣe agbara ipa.','Capabilities > Show private post types. Include non-public post types when editing role capabilities, not the Editor Features setting.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ya > Ṣàfihàn awọn post type ikọkọ. Fi awọn post type ti kii ṣe àwùjọ kun nígbà tí o bá n ṣatúnṣe agbara ipa, kii ṣe àyípadà Ẹ̀ya Olùkà.','Capabilities > Application password capabilities. Enable per-application-password capability restrictions.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ya > Agbara ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo. Mu awọn ihamọ agbara ọrọigbaniwọle fun ohun elo kọọkan ṣiṣẹ.','Roles > Multiples roles on "Add New User" screen. Allow assigning multiple roles when creating a new user. This is separate from editing existing users.'=>'Àwọn Ipa > Ipa pupọ lori "Fikun Un Olùkọ tuntun" iboju. Gba laaye lati yan awọn ipa pupọ nígbà tí o bá n ṣẹda olùkọ tuntun. Eyi jẹ́ yàtọ̀ sí ṣatúnṣe awọn olùkọ to wa.','Roles > Multiples roles on "User Edit" screen. Enable multiple-role editing for existing users on Edit User. This is separate from Add New User.'=>'Àwọn Ipa > Ipa pupọ lori "Ṣatúnṣe Olùkọ" iboju. Mu ṣatúnṣe ipa pupọ ṣiṣẹ fun awọn olùkọ to wa lori Ṣatúnṣe Olùkọ. Eyi jẹ́ yàtọ̀ sí Fikun Un Olùkọ tuntun.','Editor Features > Classic Editor tab. Show controls for Classic Editor restrictions.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ya Olùkà > Ẹ̀ka Ẹ̀ya Iṣàkóso. Ṣàfihàn awọn iṣakoso fun awọn ihamọ Ẹ̀ya Iṣàkóso.','User Testing > Admin Bar. Add the user-testing link to the admin toolbar.'=>'Àwọn Igbeyewo Olùkọ > Bàrùú Olùkọ. Fi ọna asopọ igbeyewo olùkọ kun si bàrùú admin.','User Testing > Admin Bar search. Allow searching for a user to test from the toolbar.'=>'Àwọn Igbeyewo Olùkọ > Ṣawari Bàrùú Olùkọ. Gba laaye lati wa olùkọ kan láti ṣàdédé láti toolbar.','User Testing > Front End footer notice. Show a return link while testing a user.'=>'Àwọn Igbeyewo Olùkọ > Ika ìkànsí iwájú. Ṣàfihàn ọna asopọ ìpadabọ nígbà tí o bá n ṣàdédé olùkọ kan.','Admin Menus > Treatment of multiple roles. True selects most restrictive, false selects most permissive.'=>'Àwọn Akojọ Olùkà > Itọju awọn ipa pupọ. Otitọ yan ti o dara julọ, irò yan ti o gbooro julọ.','Profile Features > Automatic redirection. Control automatic redirection during profile feature capture.'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ya Profaili > Àtúnṣe aiyipada. Ṣakoso àtúnṣe aiyipada nígbà ti a n gba ẹya profaili.','Redirects > Return to the same page. Track the last visited page for applicable login redirects.'=>'Àtúnṣe > Padà sí oju-iwe kanna. Tọpinpin oju-iwe ti o kẹhin ti a ṣàbẹwò fun awọn àtúnṣe ìkànsí tí o yẹ.','User Testing > Exclude role from User Testing. List role slugs whose users cannot be tested.'=>'Àwọn Igbeyewo Olùkọ > Kò fi ipa kan silẹ lati Igbeyewo Olùkọ. Ṣe akojọ awọn slug ipa ti awọn olùkọ wọn ko le ṣe ayẹwo.','Pro > Display PublishPress branding. Show or hide plugin branding.'=>'Pro > Ṣàfihàn ìbrandi PublishPress. Ṣàfihàn tàbí pa ìbrandi plugin.','Pro > Custom status control. Enable supported custom status capability handling when the status integration is available.'=>'Pro > Iṣakoso ipo aṣa. Mu iṣakoso agbara ipo aṣa ti a ṣe atilẹyin ṣiṣẹ nígbà ti isopọ ipo wa.','Pro > Custom status post permissions. Enable post-specific status capabilities. Requires custom status control.'=>'Pro > Awọn igbanilaaye ipo aṣa. Mu awọn agbara ipo pataki fun ìkànsí ṣiṣẹ. Nilo iṣakoso ipo aṣa.','Pro > Privacy statuses. Enable privacy status integration when its dependencies are available.'=>'Pro > Awọn ipo ìpamọ. Mu isopọ ipo ìpamọ ṣiṣẹ nígbà ti awọn ẹtọ rẹ wa.','Pro > Custom privacy editing capabilities. Use the available privacy integration editing rules.'=>'Pro > Awọn agbara àtúnṣe ìpamọ aṣa. Lo awọn ofin àtúnṣe isopọ ìpamọ ti o wa.','Use the exact setting types shown in discovery. Lists must contain values of the declared type.'=>'Lo awọn irú eto gangan ti a fihan ninu ìwà. Àwọn akojọ gbọdọ ni awọn iye ti a ṣàpèjúwe.','An excluded role does not exist.'=>'Ipa ti a ko fi silẹ ko si.','MCP tools cannot grant administrator-level access. Use the WordPress admin screens for this change.'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ MCP ko le fun ni iraye si ipele admin. Lo awọn iboju admin WordPress fun ayipada yii.','Use the element identifier returned by discovery.'=>'Lo idanimọ èlémẹ́ntì ti a fi pada nipasẹ ìwà.','An element label is required.'=>'Iru èlémẹ́ntì ti wa ni ibeere.','A selector is required.'=>'A nilo olùṣàkóso.','A selector, stylesheet, or body class is required.'=>'A nilo olùṣàkóso, stylesheet, tàbí kilasi ara.','Specify page types or post types.'=>'Ṣàpèjúwe iru oju-iwe tàbí iru post.','A post type does not exist.'=>'Iru post kan ko si.','Element not found.'=>'Èlémẹ́ntì kò rí.','The menu action is missing required fields.'=>'Ìṣe akojọ naa padanu àwọn àpoti to nilo.','Unsupported menu action.'=>'Ìṣe akojọ ti ko ni atilẹyin.','You cannot manage this application password.'=>'O ko le ṣakoso ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo yi.','A capability is not recognized.'=>'A ko mọ agbara kan.','Use restriction_value exactly as returned. If discovery is empty or a menu is missing, open the Admin Menus page as an authorized administrator, then request choices again. Do not invent identifiers or infer which menus a role can access from this snapshot.'=>'Lo restriction_value gangan bi a ṣe pada. Ti ìwàláàyè ba ṣofo tabi ti akojọ aṣayan kan ba ṣofo, ṣii oju-iwe Akojọ aṣayan Alakoso gẹgẹbi alakoso ti a fun ni aṣẹ, lẹhinna beere awọn aṣayan lẹẹkansi. Ma ṣe ṣẹda awọn idanimọ tabi ro iru awọn akojọ aṣayan ti ipa kan le wọle si lati snapshot yi.','A new menu restriction was not found in discovery. Request get-feature-choices for admin-menus and use its restriction_value. If missing, open the Admin Menus page and try again.'=>'A ko ri idena akojọ tuntun ninu ìwàláàyè. Beere get-feature-choices fun admin-menus ki o lo restriction_value rẹ. Ti o ba ṣofo, ṣii oju-iwe Akojọ aṣayan Alakoso ki o gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','The Pro settings integration is not available.'=>'Iṣọpọ awọn eto Pro ko si.','Custom status settings are unavailable or controlled by the active status integration.'=>'Awọn eto ipo aṣa ko si tabi ni iṣakoso nipasẹ iṣọpọ ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Enable supported custom status control before status-specific editing capabilities.'=>'Mu iṣakoso ipo aṣa ti a ṣe atilẹyin ṣiṣẹ ṣaaju awọn agbara ṣiṣatunkọ pato ipo.','Privacy settings require the active Permissions Pro status integration.'=>'Awọn eto ìpamọ nilo iṣọpọ ipo Permissions Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ.','A requested privacy setting is locked by site configuration.'=>'Ipo ìpamọ ti a beere ti wa ni lock nipasẹ iṣeto aaye.','Use an unused role slug, 2–40 lowercase letters, numbers or underscores, starting with a letter.'=>'Lo slug ipa ti ko lo, 2–40 lẹta kekere, awọn nọmba tabi awọn isalẹ, ti n bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu lẹta kan.','A capability already uses this name.'=>'Agbara kan ti lo orukọ yi tẹlẹ.','The source role is not editable.'=>'Ipa orisun ko le ṣe atunṣe.','A role name is required.'=>'Orukọ ipa kan jẹ dandan.','The role could not be created.'=>'Ipa naa ko le ṣẹda.','You cannot change that capability.'=>'O ko le yi agbara yẹn pada.','Administrators must retain read, manage_options and manage_capabilities.'=>'Awọn alakoso gbọdọ pa awọn iwe, ṣakoso awọn aṣayan ati ṣakoso awọn agbara.','The default role must retain read access.'=>'Ipa aiyipada gbọdọ pa wiwọle kika.','This role must retain read access to avoid dashboard lockout.'=>'Ipa yi gbọdọ pa wiwọle kika lati yago fun idinamọ dashboard.','System, default and uneditable roles cannot be deleted.'=>'Awọn eto eto, aiyipada ati awọn ipa ti a ko le ṣe atunṣe ko le parẹ.','You cannot delete your own role.'=>'O ko le pa ipa tirẹ run.','The role could not be deleted.'=>'Ipa naa ko le parẹ.','PublishPress Permissions is not active.'=>'PublishPress Permissions ko ṣiṣẹ.','Only the main-site network administrator can configure new-site roles.'=>'Nikan alakoso nẹtiwọọki aaye akọkọ le ṣeto awọn ipa aaye tuntun.','Classic Editor is not installed.'=>'Classic Editor ko ti fi sori ẹrọ.','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce ko ṣiṣẹ.','You cannot lock out administrators or your own role.'=>'O ko le pa awọn alakoso tabi ipa tirẹ run.','The default role cannot be disabled.'=>'Ipa aiyipada ko le dènà.','This role level cannot be changed.'=>'Ipele ipa yi ko le yipada.','List roles'=>'Akojọ awọn ipa','List the current site’s registered role slugs and names. Does not change roles or return users.'=>'Akojọ awọn slug ipa ti a forukọsilẹ ati awọn orukọ aaye lọwọlọwọ. Ko yipada awọn ipa tabi pada awọn olumulo.','Get role capabilities'=>'Gba awọn agbara ipa','Read a registered role’s stored capability grants and denials. These are role settings, not an individual user’s effective permissions.'=>'Ka awọn ẹbun agbara ti a fipamọ ti ipa ti a forukọsilẹ ati awọn ikọlu. Eyi jẹ awọn eto ipa, kii ṣe awọn aṣẹ ti olumulo kan.','User not found on this site.'=>'Ko si olumulo ti a ri lori aaye yi.','Enable multiple-role editing in the plugin settings first.'=>'Mu ṣiṣatunkọ ipa pupọ ṣiṣẹ ni awọn eto afikun akọkọ.','Products'=>'Awọn ọja','Orders'=>'Awọn aṣẹ','Subscriptions'=>'Awọn ìforúkọsílẹ','Upsell Paths'=>'Awọn Ọna Upsell','Permissions & Access'=>'Awọn Aṣẹ & Wiwọle','Administer advanced content permissions and visibility rules.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn igbanilaaye akoonu to ti ni ilọsiwaju ati awọn ofin wiwo.','Manage plugin permission settings.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn eto igbanilaaye plugin.','Bypass content restrictions for editorial workflows.'=>'Bẹrẹ awọn ihamọ akoonu fun awọn ṣiṣan iṣẹ redio.','Set custom post statuses for content items.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ipo ifiweranṣẹ aṣa fun awọn nkan akoonu.','Force Quick Edit access when restrictions would otherwise block it.'=>'Fi iraye si Ṣatunkọ Yara mu nigbati awọn ihamọ ba le dina rẹ.','Roles & Groups'=>'Awọn ipa & Awọn ẹgbẹ','Assign or change role assignments for users.'=>'Yàn tabi yi awọn atokọ ipa pada fun awọn olumulo.','Create new permission groups.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye tuntun.','Edit existing permission groups.'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye to wa tẹlẹ.','Delete permission groups.'=>'Pa awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye run.','Add or remove members from permission groups.'=>'Fi awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ kun tabi yọ wọn kuro ninu awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye.','Create network-wide permission groups in multisite.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye ni gbogbo nẹtiwọọki ni multisite.','Manage members of network-wide permission groups.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ ti awọn ẹgbẹ igbanilaaye ni gbogbo nẹtiwọọki.','Exception Management'=>'Iṣakoso Aiyipada','Set per-item association exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ asopọ fun nkan kọọkan.','Set per-item edit exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ ṣiṣatunkọ fun nkan kọọkan.','Set per-item read exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ kika fun nkan kọọkan.','Set per-item revision exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ atunṣe fun nkan kọọkan.','Set taxonomy term assignment exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ atokọ ọrọ taxonomy.','Set taxonomy term association exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ asopọ ọrọ taxonomy.','Set taxonomy term management exceptions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ihamọ iṣakoso ọrọ taxonomy.','Content Associations'=>'Awọn Asopọ Akọkọ','Associate users or groups with any page.'=>'So awọn olumulo tabi awọn ẹgbẹ pọ pẹlu eyikeyi oju-iwe.','Define and apply custom post statuses.'=>'Ṣe alaye ati lo awọn ipo ifiweranṣẹ aṣa.','Define custom privacy policies for content.'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn ilana ipamọ aṣiri aṣa fun akoonu.','Moderate any item regardless of authorship.'=>'Ṣakoso eyikeyi nkan laibikita onkọwe.','Media & Misc'=>'Media & Misc','Edit attachments uploaded by the current user.'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn asopọ ti a gbe silẹ nipasẹ olumulo lọwọlọwọ.','List unattached files uploaded by other users.'=>'Atokọ awọn faili ti a ko so mọ ti a gbe silẹ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran.','List all media library files.'=>'Atokọ gbogbo awọn faili ile-ikawe media.','Exempt user from edit-circle restrictions.'=>'Gba olumulo laaye lati yọkuro ninu awọn ihamọ ṣiṣatunkọ.','Exempt user from read-circle restrictions.'=>'Gba olumulo laaye lati yọkuro ninu awọn ihamọ kika.','see %1$sRole Usage%2$s: "Pattern Roles"'=>'wo %1$sIṣakoso Ipa%2$s: "Awọn Ipa Àpẹẹrẹ"','activate %1$sAdvanced settings%2$s, see Role Usage'=>'mu %1$sEto to ti ni ilọsiwaju%2$s ṣiṣẹ, wo Iṣakoso Ipa','"Posts" capabilities selected here also define type-specific role assignment for Permission Groups%s.'=>'"Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ" awọn agbara ti a yan nibi tun ṣe alaye atokọ ipa pato fun Awọn Ẹgbẹ Igbanilaaye%s.','"Posts" capabilities selected here also define type-specific role assignment for Permit Groups%s.'=>'"Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ" awọn agbara ti a yan nibi tun ṣe alaye atokọ ipa pato fun Awọn Ẹgbẹ Permit%s.','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added here. (See %sPermissions > Post Statuses%s for applicable names). %sSupplemental status-specific roles%s are usually more convenient, though.'=>'Awọn agbara fun awọn ipo aṣa le ṣee fi kun nibi ni ọwọ. (Wo %sIgbanilaaye > Awọn ipo Ifiweranṣẹ%s fun awọn orukọ to wulo). %sAwọn ipa pataki pato ti ipo%s jẹ igbagbogbo rọrun diẹ sii, sibẹsibẹ.','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added here. Or activate the PP Custom Post Statuses extension to assign status-specific supplemental roles.'=>'Awọn agbara fun awọn ipo aṣa le ṣee fi kun nibi ni ọwọ. Tabi mu awọn afikun PP Custom Post Statuses ṣiṣẹ lati yan awọn ipa pataki pato ti ipo.','Capabilities for custom statuses can be manually added to a role here (see Conditions > Status > Capability Mapping for applicable names). However, it is usually more convenient to use Permit Groups to assign a supplemental status-specific role.'=>'Awọn agbara fun awọn ipo aṣa le ṣee fi kun si ipa nibi (wo Awọn ipo > Ipo > Mape Agbara fun awọn orukọ to wulo). Sibẹsibẹ, o jẹ igbagbogbo rọrun diẹ sii lati lo Awọn Ẹgbẹ Permit lati yan ipa pataki pato ti ipo.','Unique Post Type Capabilities'=>'Awọn Agbara Iru Ifiweranṣẹ Alailẹgbẹ','Allow post type permissions to be controlled separately from other areas of WordPress. %1$sFind out more.%2$s'=>'Jẹ ki awọn igbanilaaye iru ifiweranṣẹ jẹ iṣakoso ni pataki lati awọn agbegbe miiran ti WordPress. %1$sWa alaye siwaju.%2$s','Use the "Create" capability for selected post types'=>'Lo agbara "Ṣẹda" fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan','This will cause a new capability to be required for creating posts, and enable a checkbox column here for role assignments. Normally, post creation is controlled by the "Edit" capability.'=>'Eyi yoo fa ki a nilo agbara tuntun fun ṣiṣe awọn ifiweranṣẹ, ati pe o le mu akojọ ayẹwo kan nibi fun awọn atokọ ipa. Ni deede, iṣakoso ifiweranṣẹ ni a n ṣe nipasẹ agbara "Ṣatunkọ".','Update'=>'Imudojuiwọn','Unique Taxonomy Capabilities'=>'Agbara Taxonomy Alailẹgbẹ','Allow taxonomy permissions to be controlled separately from other areas of WordPress.'=>'Jọwọ gba awọn igbanilaaye taxonomy laaye lati wa ni iṣakoso ni iyatọ lati awọn agbegbe miiran ti WordPress.','Detailed Taxonomy Capabilities'=>'Awọn Agbara Taxonomy Alaye','Allow "Edit", "Delete" and "Assign" capabilities separately from the "Manage" capability.'=>'Jọwọ gba awọn agbara "Ṣatunkọ", "Pa" ati "Atunṣe" laaye ni iyatọ lati agbara "Iṣakoso".','Login Redirect'=>'Tun-ṣe Iwọle','Logout Redirect'=>'Tun-ṣe Ijade','Registration Redirect'=>'Tun-ṣe Iforukọsilẹ','First Login Redirect'=>'Iwọle akọkọ Tun-ṣe','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after login.'=>'Tẹ URL ti awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii yẹ ki o tun-ṣe si lẹyin iwọle.','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after logout.'=>'Tẹ URL ti awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii yẹ ki o tun-ṣe si lẹyin jade.','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after registration.'=>'Tẹ URL ti awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii yẹ ki o tun-ṣe si lẹyin iforukọsilẹ.','Enter the URL users in this role should be redirected to after their first login.'=>'Tẹ URL ti awọn olumulo ninu ipa yii yẹ ki o tun-ṣe si lẹyin iwọle wọn akọkọ.','%s Redirects'=>'%s Tun-ṣe','Save Changes'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Ayipada','Redirect users to the URL they were viewing before login.'=>'Tun-ṣe awọn olumulo si URL ti wọn n wo ṣaaju iwọle.','Redirect users to a specified URL.'=>'Tun-ṣe awọn olumulo si URL ti a ti sọ.','Enter the relative path only without domain for login redirect.'=>'Tẹ ọna ibatan nikan laisi agbegbe fun tun-ṣe iwọle.','You must enter the Login Redirect URL.'=>'O gbọdọ tẹ URL Tun-ṣe Iwọle.','Enter the relative path only without domain for logout redirect.'=>'Tẹ ọna ibatan nikan laisi agbegbe fun tun-ṣe jade.','Redirect Features allows you to redirect users in a role after Registration, Login or Logout.'=>'Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tun-ṣe ngbanilaaye fun ọ lati tun-ṣe awọn olumulo ninu ipa kan lẹhin Iforukọsilẹ, Iwọle tabi Ijade.','How to use Redirect Features'=>'Bawo ni a ṣe le lo Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tun-ṣe','You do not have sufficient permissions to perform this action.'=>'O ko ni awọn igbanilaaye to peye lati ṣe iṣe yii.','Your link has expired, refresh the page and try again.'=>'Asopọ rẹ ti pari, tun ṣe oju-iwe naa ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Please try again.'=>'Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Missing parameters, refresh the page and try again.'=>'Awọn paramita ti o padanu, tun ṣe oju-iwe naa ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Invalid role name entry: %s'=>'Iforukọsilẹ orukọ ipa ti ko tọ: %s','The role "%s" already exists. Please choose a different name.'=>'Ipa "%s" ti wa tẹlẹ. Jọwọ yan orukọ ti o yatọ.','Something went wrong, the system wasn\'t able to create the role, refresh the page and try again.'=>'Nkan kan ṣẹlẹ, eto naa ko le ṣẹda ipa naa, tun ṣe oju-iwe naa ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','The new role %s was created successfully.'=>'Ipa tuntun %s ti ṣẹda ni aṣeyọri.','The default role cannot be disabled. Change the default role in WordPress settings first.'=>'Ipa aiyipada ko le pa. Yi ipa aiyipada pada ni awọn eto WordPress akọkọ.','%s role updated successfully.'=>'%s ipa ti imudojuiwọn ni aṣeyọri.','Cannot delete default role. You <a href="%s">have to change it first</a>.'=>'Ko le pa ipa aiyipada. O <a href="%s">ni lati yi i pada akọkọ</a>.','Deleting a system role is not allowed.'=>'Piparẹ ipa eto ko gba laaye.','%1$d users moved to default role %2$s.'=>'%1$d awọn olumulo ti gbe si ipa aiyipada %2$s.','The role %1$s was successfully deleted. %2$s'=>'Ipa %1$s ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri. %2$s','The selected %1$s roles were successfully deleted. %2$s'=>'Awọn ipa %1$s ti a yan ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri. %2$s','The role %1$s was successfully hidden.'=>'Ipa %1$s ti wa ni ikọkọ ni aṣeyọri.','The role %1$s was successfully unhidden.'=>'Iṣẹ %1$s ti wa ni aṣeyọri ti ko farapamọ.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Disable / Delete'=>'Dena / Pa','Gutenberg editor'=>'Gutenberg editor','Classic editor'=>'Classic editor','Role Slug'=>'Role Slug','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the role. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers and underscores.'=>'“Slug” jẹ ẹya URL-ore ti iṣẹ naa. O jẹ nigbagbogbo gbogbo kekere ati pe o ni awọn lẹta, awọn nọmba ati awọn underscore nikan.','Block Login'=>'Dena Iwọle','Block users in this role from logging into the site.'=>'Dena awọn olumulo ni iṣẹ yii lati wọle si aaye naa.','Block Dashboard Access'=>'Dena Iraye si Dashboard','Block users in this role from accessing admin area.'=>'Dena awọn olumulo ni iṣẹ yii lati wọle si agbegbe admin.','Role Level'=>'Ipele Iṣẹ','Each user role has a level from 0 to 10. The Subscriber role defaults to the lowest level (0). The Administrator role defaults to level 10.'=>'Iṣẹ olumulo kọọkan ni ipele lati 0 si 10. Iṣẹ Alabapin jẹ aiyipada si ipele ti o kere julọ (0). Iṣẹ Alakoso jẹ aiyipada si ipele 10.','Disable Role'=>'Dena Iṣẹ','Disable "%s" role for new user assignments. Existing users will keep this role and its capabilities.'=>'Dena “%s” iṣẹ fun awọn ayẹwo olumulo tuntun. Awọn olumulo to wa tẹlẹ yoo tọju iṣẹ yii ati awọn agbara rẹ.','Deleting this role will completely remove it from database and is irrecoverable.'=>'Piparẹ iṣẹ yii yoo yọ kuro patapata ninu ipilẹ data ati pe ko le gba pada.','Disable Code Editor'=>'Dena Koodu Editor','Disable the "Code editor" option for the Gutenberg block editor.'=>'Dena aṣayan “Koodu editor” fun olutayo Gutenberg.','Control Allowed Editors'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Olutayo Ti a Gba laaye','Select the allowed editor options for users in this role.'=>'Yan awọn aṣayan olutayo ti a gba laaye fun awọn olumulo ni iṣẹ yii.','Disable WooCommerce admin restrictions'=>'Dena awọn ihamọ admin WooCommerce','By default, WooCommerce prevents most users from accessing the WordPress admin area. When enabled, this setting will remove those restrictions for this role. %1s Click here for more details. %2s'=>'Ni aiyipada, WooCommerce n dena awọn olumulo pupọ lati wọle si agbegbe admin WordPress. Nigbati a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, eto yii yoo yọ awọn ihamọ wọnyẹn fun iṣẹ yii. %1s Tẹ nibi fun alaye siwaju. %2s','Slug already exists'=>'Slug ti wa tẹlẹ','Select allowed editor'=>'Yan olutayo ti a gba laaye','You must select at least one editor for the role when managing allowed editor.'=>'O gbọdọ yan o kere ju olutayo kan fun iṣẹ naa nigbati o n ṣakoso olutayo ti a gba laaye.','Select %s'=>'Yan %s','Read more on Role Level.'=>'Ka siwaju lori Ipele Iṣẹ.','Are you sure you want to delete this role?'=>'Ṣe o daju pe o fẹ pa iṣẹ yii?','%s role copied. Please click the "Create Role" button to create this new role.'=>'%s iṣẹ ti daakọ. Jọwọ tẹ bọtini “Ṣẹda Iṣẹ” lati ṣẹda iṣẹ tuntun yii.','Edit Role: %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ Iṣẹ: %s','Copy Role'=>'Daakọ Iṣẹ','Create New Role'=>'Ṣẹda Iṣẹ Tuntun','These can be edited on the %1s Capabilities screen %2s'=>'Iwọnyi le ṣee ṣe atunṣe lori iboju %1s Awọn Agbara %2s','Load More'=>'Gbe sii diẹ sii','Load Less'=>'Gbe sii kere si','All %s'=>'Gbogbo %s','Mine %s'=>'Ti emi %s','Has Users %s'=>'Ni Awọn olumulo %s','No Users %s'=>'Ko si Awọn olumulo %s','Disabled %s'=>'Dena %s','Editable %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','Uneditable %s'=>'Ko ṣatunkọ %s','System %s'=>'System %s','Copy'=>'Daakọ','(non-editable role)'=>'(ipa ti ko le ṣe atunṣe)','Unhide'=>'Tọju','Select role %s'=>'Yan ipa %s','Your Role'=>'Ipa rẹ','Disabled'=>'Dákẹ́','WordPress Core'=>'WordPress Core','Search Roles'=>'Wa Awọn Ipa','Admin Menus: treatment of multiple roles'=>'Awọn akojọ aṣayan Alakoso: itọju awọn ipa pupọ','Most permissive: Any non-restricted user role allows access'=>'Jẹ́ ki o wọle: Ipa olumulo ti ko ni ihamọ eyikeyi gba wọle','Most restrictive: Any restricted user role prevents access'=>'Jẹ́ ki o dènà: Ipa olumulo ti a fi ihamọ kankan dènà wọle','This controls whether the most permissive or restrictive permissions are applied if a user has multiple roles.'=>'Eyi n ṣakoso boya awọn igbanilaaye ti o ni ẹtọ julọ tabi ti o ni ihamọ ni a lo ti olumulo ba ni awọn ipa pupọ.','Multiples roles on "Add New User" screen'=>'Awọn ipa mẹta lori "Fi olumulo tuntun kun" iboju','This allows you to assign a new user to multiples roles.'=>'Eyi ngbanilaaye fun ọ lati yan olumulo tuntun si awọn ipa mẹta.','Multiples roles on "User Edit" screen'=>'Awọn ipa mẹta lori "Ṣatunkọ Olumulo" iboju','This allows you to assign an existing user to multiple roles.'=>'Eyi ngbanilaaye fun ọ lati yan olumulo ti o wa tẹlẹ si awọn ipa pupọ.','Set login redirect cookie'=>'Ṣeto kuki itọsọna wọle','Use cookie to determine pages users were viewing before login. This is useful when login redirect is not working correctly due to wp_get_referer() limitation.'=>'Lo kuki lati pinnu awọn oju-iwe ti awọn olumulo n wo ṣaaju ki wọle. Eyi jẹ iranlọwọ nigbati itọsọna wọle ko ṣiṣẹ daradara nitori ihamọ wp_get_referer().','Show private post types'=>'Fihan awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ikọkọ','This will show all post types on the "Capabilities" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Eyi yoo fihan gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ lori iboju "Awọn agbara", paapaa awọn ti a maa n tọju ni agbegbe alakoso WordPress.','Show private taxonomies'=>'Fihan awọn taxonomies ikọkọ','This will show all taxonomies on the "Capabilities" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Eyi yoo fihan gbogbo awọn taxonomies lori iboju "Awọn agbara", paapaa awọn ti a maa n tọju ni agbegbe alakoso WordPress.','Application password capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo','Allow the Capabilities screen to deny selected capabilities for individual WordPress application passwords.'=>'Jẹ́ ki iboju Awọn Agbara dènà awọn agbara ti a yan fun awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo WordPress kọọkan.','Show all post types on the "Editor Features" screen, even ones normally hidden in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Fihan gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ lori iboju "Awọn ẹya Ẹlẹda", paapaa awọn ti a maa n tọju ni agbegbe alakoso WordPress.','Enable Classic Editor tab'=>'Mu taabu Ẹlẹda Iyatọ ṣiṣẹ','Always show the Classic Editor tab in "Editor Features" screen.'=>'Ma ṣe afihan taabu Ẹlẹda Iyatọ ni iboju "Awọn ẹya Ẹlẹda" nigbagbogbo.','Admin Bar modification'=>'Ayipada Bar Alakoso','When testing, display a caption and return link in the Admin Bar.'=>'Nigbati o ba n ṣe idanwo, fi akọle kan han ati ọna asopọ pada ni Bar Alakoso.','Admin Bar search'=>'Iwadi Bar Alakoso','Add option to search and user testing in the Admin Bar.'=>'Fi aṣayan kun lati wa ati idanwo olumulo ni Bar Alakoso.','Front End footer notice'=>'Ifiranṣẹ ikede ẹhin iwaju','When testing, display a return link in the front end footer.'=>'Nigbati o ba n ṣe idanwo, fi ọna asopọ pada han ni ẹhin iwaju.','Exclude role from User Testing'=>'Yọ ipa kuro ninu Idanwo Olumulo','Select roles...'=>'Yan awọn ipa...','Exclude users in selected roles from User Testing.'=>'Yọ awọn olumulo ninu awọn ipa ti a yan kuro ninu Idanwo Olumulo.','Automatically refresh profile elements'=>'Tun awọn eroja profaili laifọwọyi','Always try to automatically find profile elements. This may cause temporary issues when updating user roles that do not have access to the WordPress admin area.'=>'Gbiyanju nigbagbogbo lati wa awọn eroja profaili laifọwọyi. Eyi le fa awọn iṣoro igba diẹ nigbati o ba n ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn ipa olumulo ti ko ni iraye si agbegbe iṣakoso WordPress.','Capabilities Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Agbara','Search user'=>'Wa olumulo','Search user...'=>'Wa olumulo...','Search'=>'Wa','No results found.'=>'Ko si awọn esi ti a rii.','Permission denied.'=>'Aṣẹ ti kọ.','Test user'=>'Olumulo idanwo','Test this user'=>'Danwo olumulo yi','Testing: '=>'Idanwo: ','%1$sReturn to Administrator view%2$s'=>'%1$sPada si iwo Alakoso%2$s','Testing as user: %1$s. %2$sReturn to Administrator view%3$s'=>'Idanwo gẹgẹbi olumulo: %1$s. %2$sPada si iwo Alakoso%3$s','Back to Users'=>'Pada si Awọn Olumulo','You are viewing the capabilities for this specific user.'=>'Iwọ n wo awọn agbara fun olumulo pataki yii.','Username'=>'Orukọ olumulo','Email'=>'Imeeli','Assigned Roles'=>'Awọn ipa ti a yan','Network Access'=>'Iwọle Nẹtiwọọki','Super Admin'=>'Alakoso Giga','Granted Capabilities'=>'Awọn Agbara ti a Funni','This user has no assigned roles.'=>'Olumulo yii ko ni awọn ipa ti a yan.','Granted Capabilities (%d)'=>'Awọn Agbara ti a Funni (%d)','These include known capabilities WordPress grants through Super Admin access, role assignments, and direct overrides.'=>'Eyi pẹlu awọn agbara ti a mọ ti WordPress fun nipasẹ iwọle Alakoso Giga, awọn itọnisọna ipa, ati awọn ohun elo taara.','These are the capabilities assigned to this user in WordPress.'=>'Eyi ni awọn agbara ti a yan fun olumulo yii ni WordPress.','This user has no granted capabilities.'=>'Olumulo yii ko ni awọn agbara ti a funni.','Search granted capabilities'=>'Wa awọn agbara ti a funni','Search granted capabilities...'=>'Wa awọn agbara ti a funni...','Type to filter this capability list.'=>'Tẹ lati ṣe àlẹmọ akojọ agbara yii.','No granted capabilities match your search.'=>'Ko si awọn agbara ti a funni ti o baamu wiwa rẹ.','Denied Capabilities (%d)'=>'Aṣẹ ti kọ (%d)','Direct User Overrides'=>'Awọn Aṣamọra Olumulo Taara','These entries are stored directly on the user account instead of coming from a role.'=>'Awọn iforukọsilẹ wọnyi ti wa ni fipamọ taara lori akọọlẹ olumulo dipo ki o wa lati inu ipa kan.','These are permissions assigned to the user in the PublishPress Permissions plugin.'=>'Eyi ni awọn aṣẹ ti a yan fun olumulo ni afikun PublishPress Permissions plugin.','Extra Roles (%d)'=>'Awọn Ipa afikun (%d)','This user has no direct extra roles.'=>'Olumulo yii ko ni awọn ipa afikun taara.','Specific Permissions (%d)'=>'Awọn Aṣẹ Pataki (%d)','This user has no direct specific permissions.'=>'Olumulo yii ko ni awọn aṣẹ pataki taara.','Showing the first 50 of %d permissions. Use the Permissions editor to view the full list.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ awọn 50 akọkọ ti %d awọn aṣẹ. Lo olootu Aṣẹ lati wo akojọ pipe.','Inherited Group Permissions'=>'Awọn Aṣẹ Ẹgbẹ ti a gba','Extra roles and specific permissions assigned to this user\'s active groups, including WordPress role groups. These assignments are managed on the group.'=>'Awọn ipa afikun ati awọn aṣẹ pataki ti a yan fun awọn ẹgbẹ ti o ṣiṣẹ ti olumulo yii, pẹlu awọn ẹgbẹ ipa WordPress. Awọn itọnisọna wọnyi ni a ṣakoso lori ẹgbẹ naa.','This user has no group-assigned extra roles or specific permissions.'=>'Olumulo yi ko ni awọn ipa afikun ti a yàn ẹgbẹ tabi awọn aṣẹ pato.','View Extra Roles'=>'Wo Awọn Ipa Afikun','View Specific Permissions'=>'Wo Awọn Aṣẹ Pataki','You cannot change roles for this user.'=>'O ko le yi awọn ipa pada fun olumulo yi.','Choose existing roles that you are allowed to assign.'=>'Yan awọn ipa ti o wa ti o jẹwọ lati yàn.','A disabled role cannot be assigned.'=>'Ipa ti a dènà ko le jẹ yàn.','You cannot remove your own roles through this action.'=>'O ko le yọ awọn ipa tirẹ kuro nipasẹ iṣe yi.']];